<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<data>
  <scripts>
    <scene id="00" title="Wedge" root="true">
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>In the endless darkness, [\s]the dead Celestial's consciousness awakened.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-01白光转场" />
      <delay t="0.15" />
      <transition in="1" stop="0.5" out="1.5" color="#ffffff" mode="fade" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>In the beginning, the new consciousness was like the birth of the world:[\s]</p>
        <p>just a spot of light in the universe.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-01恢复意识" looptimes="-1" />
      <bg img="BGIntel1" duration="3" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>『Its』power was still limited. [\s] It could neither receive signals from the senses, nor send them to the nerves.</p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="BGIntel3" duration="5" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>In that chaos, the weak consciousness followed its ancient instincts.[\s]</p>
        <p>Blindly but firmly, it awakened and started growing.</p>
      </mono>
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>It has not realized its own death yet.[\s]</p>
        <p>The girl refused to acknowledge her own death.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-01恢复意识" looptimes="0" />
      <transition in="2" stop="0" out="0" color="#ffffff" mode="dissolve" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.2" out="1.5" color="#FFFFFF" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Judging by common sense, the immortal Celestial was indeed dead.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢碎片1" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono>Her right leg had been cut off from the ankle down.</mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢碎片2" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono>Her hands were crippled.</mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢碎片3" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono>All her internal organs were destroyed.</mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢碎片4" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Her chest had taken more than a dozen blows.</p>
      </mono>
      <cg duration="0.5" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>However, the deadliest wound was on her head.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition in="0.6" stop="0" out="0" color="#8b0000" mode="dissolve" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.2" out="0.15" color="#8b0000" />
      <se id="01-02大剑命中" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="80" direction="horizontal" />
      <bg img="BGBlood1" />
      <mono>It was wounded by a sword.</mono>
      <mono inline="true">
        <p />
        <p>The sword struck her forehead,</p>
      </mono>
      <mono inline="true"> destroyed her brain</mono>
      <mono> and passed through to the back of her head.</mono>
      <mono>If it were for any other person, they would have died with just one of those injuries.</mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>But the「Celestial」wasn't ordinary.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="eye" in="2" stop="0" out="2" color="#000000" />
      <se id="01-03野外小屋loop" looptimes="-1" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢沉睡" duration="0" origin="15%,0%" scale="2" />
      <delay t="2.2" />
      <bg />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono pageend="true">The Celestial is an immortal being that never died.</mono>
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono>
        <p>Her body wouldn't die even after thousands of years,[\s]</p>
        <p>neither would her soul, even after tens of thousands of years.[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>She completely overthrew the laws of nature,[\s]</p>
        <p>she was the one and only Celestial of Shenzhou.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>This was the very essence of the body that was now lying still in the stone chamber.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>And so,</mono>
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <se id="01-03野外小屋loop" looptimes="0" />
      <se id="01-04痊愈loop" looptimes="-1" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢沉睡" duration="8" scale="1" origin="15%,0%" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>starting from each braincell,[\s]</p>
        <p>the Celestial's mind and body began a long period of repair and reconstruction.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <delay t="7" />
      <mono pageend="true">Drawing on every breath from her surroundings,</mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢沉睡2" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <se id="01-05痊愈" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>patching up the torn skin,</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢沉睡3" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <se id="01-06痊愈" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>healing the broken bones,</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢沉睡4" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <se id="01-07痊愈" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>tying up the crumbling muscles,</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢沉睡5" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <se id="01-05痊愈" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>repairing the damaged organs…</p>
      </mono>
      <delay t="2" />
      <transition in="3" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#ffffff" mode="halo" />
      <se id="01-04痊愈loop" looptimes="0" />
      <cg />
      <transition in="0" stop="0" out="1" color="#ffffff" mode="fade" />
      <bgm id="千年之羽" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Gradually, the Celestial's 『consciousness』started perceiving its surroundings.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="move" in="1" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="thick" />
      <letterbox action="show_letterbox" height="400" duration="0" />
      <se id="01-03野外小屋loop" looptimes="-1" />
      <bg img="BGSky00" />
      <mono>She saw the line of light and shadow going from east to west and from west to east through the little window of the chamber.</mono>
      <letterbox action="show_letterbox" height="300" duration="1" />
      <bg img="BGSky01" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>She could smell the odor of the withering plants mixing with rotting insects.</p>
      </mono>
      <letterbox action="show_letterbox" height="200" duration="1" />
      <bg img="BGSky02" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>She heard the sound of falling leaves, welcoming the autumn, and the snow-covered branches swaying.</p>
      </mono>
      <letterbox action="show_letterbox" duration="1" height="100" />
      <bg img="BGSky04" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p>Then, she felt pain,[\s] numbness,[\s] swelling,[\s] itching…[\s] every part of her body was screaming.[\s]</p>
        <p>An endless torment took her over…</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-03野外小屋loop" looptimes="0" />
      <letterbox action="hide_letterbox" duration="0" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" duration="3" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>…an endless recovery,[\s] an endless pain.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The Celestial remained silent.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-08扰乱心神杂音loop" looptimes="-1" />
      <bg img="BGNeuron03" duration="3" />
      <mono chara="000" pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>「     Who         am         I         ?      」</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Her mind was still confused. [\s]</p>
        <p>She remembered some things but forgot more and more.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono chara="000" pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>「     Where         is         this         ?      」</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>With just fragments in her memory, she couldn't put together the answer she seeked.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono chara="000" pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>「     …          wh-          ?      」</p>
      </mono>
      <bgm id="千年之羽" looptimes="0" />
      <se id="01-08扰乱心神杂音loop" looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="余烬" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢沉睡end" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Suddenly[\s]</p>
        <p>thinking of that made long abandoned emotions swell up in her chest.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-09心跳loop" looptimes="-1" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="0.5" />
      <motion action="shake" chara="-4" range="30" direction="default" duration="0.1" delay="0.1" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Seven…</p>
      </mono>
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>The Seven people closest to her.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>The Seven Swords that stayed by her side for the longest time.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="30" direction="default" looptimes="1" />
      <mono pageend="true" inline="true">
        <p />
        <p>Seven people that conspired, lured her to doom.[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>Seven Swords that trapped her and killed her.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-09心跳loop" looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="dissolve" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <cg />
      <mono chara="000" pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>「       …              Why         ?      」</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="BGNeuron01" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢沉睡end" />
      <mono pageend="true" inline="true">
        <p>Many emotions swelled up endlessly:[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>anger,[\s]</p>
        <p>doubt,[\s]</p>
        <p>resentment,[\s]</p>
        <p>fury,[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>and sadness, at the end.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono chara="000">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>「 …why? 」</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>There was no answer, only the desire to find one.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_赤鸢苏醒end" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>…the Celestial decided to wait.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>She has protected this land for countless years.[\s]</p>
        <p>Time didn't matter for her anymore.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true" inline="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>She would keep waiting until her body and mind are fully healed,[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>then she would find those Seven[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>and ask them why they killed her.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p>A strong desire was branded deep into her consciousness,[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>urging her,[\s]</p>
        <p>pushing her,[\s]</p>
        <p>changing her.[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>The wait became a habit[\s]</p>
        <p>and the pain became natural.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>And then…</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="clock" in="2" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0" out="2" color="#000000" />
      <cg />
      <mono>
        <p>Pain[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>       Pain[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>              Pain[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>                     Pain[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>Endless recovery and endless pain.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p>The Celestial remained silent.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition in="1" stop="0.1" out="1" color="#000000" mode="dissolve" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>She had been enduring this for a long time,</p>
        <p />
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p>she could still endure it.</p>
      </mono>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <event action="hide_ui" />
      <transition in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" mode="fade" />
      <bg img="Chapter01" />
      <delay t="2.5" />
      <se id="01-10标题试剑" />
      <delay t="6" />
      <transition in="2" stop="3" out="0" color="#000000" mode="fade" />
      <event action="goto" to="01" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="01" prev="00" title="The Stop">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="3" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="中原传说" />
      <bg img="沙漠驿站" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>It was a tiny stop in the desert.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono inline="true">
        <p />
        <p>1400 years ago, wandering Turkish people discovered an oasis here.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>They gave thanks to the gods for their protection, drank water to their heart’s content, and soon left.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono inline="true">
        <p />
        <p>300 years later, a caravan from the Yan Kingdom passed this place.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono inline="true">
        <p />
        <p>The caravan carried jewelry, jade, cotton and silk brocade, accompanied by a diplomatic envoy.</p>
        <p>The value of this person was worth more than the sum of the caravan’s goods, because he shouldered the important mission of traveling to the Western Regions, communicating and building alliances.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>The merchants rested at this stop, and took off the next day.</p>
        <p>But they never made it out of the Northern Desert and no one knew their whereabouts.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono inline="true">
        <p />
        <p>740 years ago, the Banyu nomads set up a camp here.</p>
        <p />
        <p>The patriarch told her people: 「Because of this water source, the Banyu people shall never have to wander again.」</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>100 years later, the Huns came from the north. They swept the Banyu village, killed all the old and middle-aged men, took all the women and young children, and went to the remote Western Regions.</p>
        <p />
        <p>…The oasis was left behind by the Huns, forgotten once more by the world.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Years passed by like flowing water, and the world changed rapidly.[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>Civilizations rose and fell; humans came and went, but they all sunk into the endless sands of the long river of history.</p>
      </mono>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="2" stop="1" out="2" color="#000000" />
      <se id="01-11沙漠环境loop（有风沙）" looptimes="0" />
      <bg img="氛围_第一折_烈阳" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1.2" />
      <bg img="氛围_第一折_烈阳" duration="3" scale="1.2" origin="80%,20%" />
      <delay t="3.2" />
      <bgm id="神秘东方" />
      <text>Looking up, the great sun was burning high above, its bright rays illuminating the earth.</text>
      <se id="01-12沙漠环境（无风沙）" looptimes="-1" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="9" />
      <bg img="BGDesert01" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <bg img="BGDesert03" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <bg img="BGDesert02" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <se id="01-12沙漠环境（无风沙）" looptimes="0" />
      <text>Looking around in the steaming heat, layers of sand dunes were like waves rippling endlessly.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="095" action="show" pos="right" img="砂匪2-中-普通" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <se id="01-14男气声哎" />
      <dialog chara="095">*sigh*</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>The inhabitant of the oasis sighed beneath the shadows of the ancient wall.[\s]</p>
        <p>He had seen the scene of this dull and sunbathed desert for three months now.</p>
      </text>
      <se id="01-13男气声哎" />
      <dialog chara="095">*sigh*</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>The man sighed again.</p>
        <p>The desert’s heat and desolation were agitating him.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Looking around, everything in his vision remained the same;</p>
        <p>the sun, the sky, the yellow sand… were all immobile and motionless.</p>
        <p>Even the air was stiff, there was not a breeze around him.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="095" action="img_trans" img="砂匪2-中-惊慌" />
      <dialog chara="095">「Rong… how’s it going over there?」</dialog>
      <motion chara="095" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="right" custom="default" />
      <bg img="BGDesert02" />
      <motion chara="094" action="show" pos="left" img="砂匪1-远-普通" />
      <dialog chara="094">「……」</dialog>
      <text>In the distance, his companion responded by simply shaking his head, signaling nothing out of the ordinary was spotted.</text>
      <text>
        <p>The other man knew very well that the man was just starting a conversation to alleviate his boredom.</p>
        <p>But in this desert, hot as an oven, talking was a luxury.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Opening his mouth would be a waste of saliva.</p>
        <p>It wouldn't be worth the effort for the 「Golden Sand Gang」.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="094" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <bg img="BGDesert01" />
      <motion chara="095" action="show" pos="right" img="砂匪2-中-普通" />
      <remark>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>NB:</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>『*』represent swear words. To avoid adverse effects, they are represented here with these asterisks. The contents are left to your imagination. Or please ignore it.</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>Characters in the story may utter curse words due to factors such as their origins, environment, and education. However, in order to respect the characters' personalities, some of these words are hidden in the novel. We hope that you understand.</p>
      </remark>
      <dialog chara="095">「Fine, okay… **, I got it.」</dialog>
      <text>He touched the closed door and licked his lips sadly.</text>
      <text>He was still a newcomer. It had only been a few months since he joined the 「Golden Sand Gang」, he had yet to learn all the rules. If he did, he would’ve known the value of water, would’ve spoken less, and would have stood still by the shadow of the ancient wall until the Boss comes back.</text>
      <motion chara="095" action="img_trans" img="砂匪2-中-微笑" />
      <remark>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>NB:</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>『*』represent swear words. To avoid adverse effects, they are represented here with these asterisks. The contents are left to your imagination. Or please ignore it.</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>Characters in the story may utter curse words due to factors such as their origins, environment, and education. However, in order to respect the characters' personalities, some of these words are hidden in the novel. We hope that you understand.</p>
      </remark>
      <dialog chara="095">「*, it’s supposed to be a big deal.」</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>The man swore out of frustration.</p>
        <p>His voice was so low, his companion couldn’t make out what he said.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="095" action="img_trans" img="砂匪2-中-普通" />
      <text>
        <p>…He knew very well that the Boss didn’t take him lightly just because he was new.</p>
        <p>Normally, gang members take turns looking after their base, it just so happened that today was his turn.</p>
      </text>
      <text>Even though the Golden Sand Gang would still reward him all the same, despite him staying back to protect the base.</text>
      <text>
        <p>But- he was a fighter, a real killer.</p>
        <p>Robbing, looting, kidnapping, murdering… These were what he signed up to do.</p>
        <p>The clashes of blades and the slicing of flesh… Those were the real rewards he sought.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>[em bold color=#ff0000]Battling[/em] and [em bold color=#ff0000]Killing[/em]; these were the things that the man valued.[\s]</p>
        <p>No doubt about it, this man was the evil amongst the evil.[\s]</p>
        <p>Not only did he bear no shame in this, he prided himself with this as proof of who he really was.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>As a result, being left out of such a 「Big Fish」 made the man feel extremely</p>
        <p>humiliated and angry.[\s]</p>
        <p>It was this anger that frustrated him and made him talkative.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="095" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <se id="01-15喝水" />
      <dialog chara="095">「Gulp——」</dialog>
      <text>The frustrated man picked up his water pouch and drank without stopping.</text>
      <dialog chara="095">「Hm——」</dialog>
      <bg img="氛围-1-素裳过曝-1" duration="5" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="4" />
      <delay t="4" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <text>The man blinked.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <bg img="氛围-1-素裳过曝-2" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <text>In front of him, a girl was walking towards them.</text>
      <text>
        <p>The man wasn’t hallucinating, this isn’t one of those "mirages" that appear in the desert.[\s]</p>
        <p>The girl… she was walking slowly towards them from the other end of the desert.</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="095">「R-Rong——!」</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>His whisper quickly dissipated in the heat.</p>
        <p>Without realizing, he had already made several big mistakes.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>First: He lost his composure.</p>
        <p>Second: He moved by himself.</p>
        <p>If this was the Big Boss, he wouldn’t have made such a big deal out of this.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>But, the 「Golden Sand Gang」 are the feared leaders of the Northern Desert.</p>
        <p>They had never met a girl that walked up to them like this.</p>
      </text>
      <text>「Who is this girl?」</text>
      <text>「Is she crazy? This place belongs to the 「Golden Sand Gang」!」</text>
      <text>「Who dares look for trouble here? And crosses the path of the 「Golden Sand Gang」 path?」</text>
      <text>…Questions after questions flashed across his mind like lightning.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <se id="01-17女孩沙漠行走loop" looptimes="-1" />
      <bg img="氛围-1-素裳过曝-3" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <dialog chara="095">「This girl… who the hell is she?」</dialog>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="3" stop="2" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="02" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="02" prev="01" title="少女">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="3" color="#000000" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <se id="01-17女孩沙漠行走loop" looptimes="-1" />
      <bg img="氛围-1-素裳过曝-3" duration="3" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <bgm id="佛心禅悟" />
      <text>The man did not know it, but despite her young age, the girl already had quite the background.</text>
      <se id="01-17女孩沙漠行走loop" looptimes="0" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="4" />
      <se id="01-16镜头拉近转场" />
      <bg img="氛围-1-素裳过曝-3" duration="4" scale="2" origin="80%,65%" />
      <delay t="4" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <text inline="true">The girl’s name was Li Sushang.</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>She was the young heiress of 「Issen Manor」 in Sichuan, the sole daughter of 「Ebonstyle」 Qin Suyi and the 7th Disciple of Empyrea Phoenix.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <bg img="氛围-1-素裳渐近-1" duration="5" scale="2" origin="80%,65%" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-专注-持剑-远景" duration="5" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <text>
        <p>Empyrea Phoenix, Ebonstyle, Issen Manor.[\s]</p>
        <p>In Shenzhou’s martial world, these were all famed and respectable names.</p>
      </text>
      <text>But here in the endless desert, these were meaningless words.</text>
      <text>
        <p>The desert was an honorless, lawless wilderness:[\s]</p>
        <p>「The strong live, the weak die.」</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-绝望张嘴-持剑-远景" />
      <text>
        <p>「Perhaps this is why,」 Sushang thought.</p>
        <p>「This is why Mother sent me to train here despite Father’s protests.」</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" duration="1" />
      <transition mode="shutter" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="忆剑山庄" />
      <text>Sushang began training when she was only a year old toddler;</text>
      <text>
        <p>Her mother doted on her a lot,</p>
        <p>but she was also extremely strict when it came to her sword training.</p>
      </text>
      <text>Sushang endured many hardships. She’d be awoken from the pain from her training at night.</text>
      <text inline="true">She would cry to her father about this—— but that would only make her mother even harsher. </text>
      <text>Not even the master of 「Issen Manor」, 「Young Marquis Of Sichuan」 Li Shen, could withstand a glance from her mother.</text>
      <text>
        <p>Since then, Sushang doubled her efforts in practicing swordmanship, and was thoroughly proficient in her family's twelve ways of Issin Mnemonics.</p>
        <p>But when her mother took a look, she still shook her head.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Sushang couldn’t understand what the problem was. Was she not training hard enough?</p>
        <p>Why wasn’t she meeting her mother’s expectations?</p>
      </text>
      <text>One day, Sushang eavesdropped on her parents’ conversation at night.</text>
      <transition mode="clock" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="忆剑山庄内" />
      <dialog chara="009">「In my opinion, the problem is your Li family’s martial arts.」</dialog>
      <text>Her mother spoke coldly.</text>
      <dialog chara="009">
        <p>「Fleeting Swallow and 13 Stances of the Diving Swift are amazing skills in the middle of Sichuan, but how about Master’s “Edge of Taixuan”?</p>
        <p>I shouldn’t have listened to your nonsense and changed Issin Mnemonics.」</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="010">「……」</dialog>
      <text>Her father whispered something, Sushang couldn’t hear him properly, but her mother gave him a cold sneer.</text>
      <dialog chara="009">「Okay, so it’s my fault now? Then I’ve wasted ten years on you in vain.」</dialog>
      <dialog chara="009">「I don’t care about you, and you don’t care about Sushang. Unlike you, she’s shown great potential in sword practice. Even if she’s not as good as Fifth Senior Sister, she’s still better than me.」</dialog>
      <text>From Sushang’s hearing outside the window, her mother sounded cold and defeated.</text>
      <dialog chara="009">
        <p>「My Blade Mantra has been damaged, yours can’t be cultivated, what can I say?[\s]</p>
        <p>Tomorrow, I will head to the Northern Desert and ask the Fifth Senior Sister to take Sushang as her disciple.」</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="009">「The Fifth Senior Sister owes me a personal favor. My face is low, but as long as I speak, she won’t refuse.」</dialog>
      <text>Her father was taken aback, then he sternly objected. Sushang was inexplicably terrified when she heard it. She wanted to agree with her father, but she was also curious about what her mother said about 「Northern Desert」 and 「Fifth Sister」.</text>
      <dialog chara="009">「——Edge of Taixuan.」</dialog>
      <text>The three short words seemed to have magical powers. As soon as they were spoken, all the noise around them disappeared, and the room fell suddenly into silence.</text>
      <dialog chara="009">「Ever since Master passed away, Lingshuang alone has mastered the Essence of Eminence in this world.」</dialog>
      <dialog chara="009">「Since Sushang wants to learn swordsmanship, why not learn from the best swordsman?」</dialog>
      <transition mode="clock" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="氛围-1-素裳过曝-1" />
      <text>
        <p>Her mother did what she said.</p>
        <p>On the day of Sushang’s fifth birthday, her parents gave her a generous parting gift.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Bidding goddbye to Issen Manor, Sichuan, and her "home", she went to the Northern Desert and learned the 「best swordsmanship」 for a whole decade.</p>
      </text>
      <notification>Unlocked Biography: 「Li Sushang」</notification>
      <event action="achievement" aid="fdc3d5e2f6d96f8d" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" img="素裳-标准-持剑-远景" duration="2" pos="center" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <text>
        <p>Ten years had suddenly passed.</p>
        <p>No longer did she yearn for her home, the only thing she still bore in her heart was her mother’s bidding.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Had her swordsmanship improved?</p>
        <p>Had her martial arts techniques improved?</p>
        <p>Did her current self finally meet her mother’s expectations?</p>
      </text>
      <text>…Sushang didn’t know, she still needed proof.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-专注-持剑-远景" />
      <text>And the way to prove it, was through a『Sword Trial』.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-浅笑-持剑-远景" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <text inline="true">Therefore, when seeing sword holding enemies approaching her in an encirclement,</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>Li Sushang’s mouth curled up into a meaningful arc.</p>
      </text>
      <text inline="true">Needless to say, this smile said everything:</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>the girl’s first 『Sword Trial』,  was today!</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" delay="2" />
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="3" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="03" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="03" type="block" prev="02" title="戦闘1">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="2" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="竹林伏兵" />
      <bg img="BGDesert00" />
      <text>(One)</text>
      <se id="01-18男性沙漠疾行_01" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="099" action="show" pos="right" img="山贼3号远景" duration="3" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <text>The girl counted silently in her head.</text>
      <text>(Two)</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <se id="01-19男性沙漠疾行_02" />
      <motion chara="095" action="show" pos="left" img="砂匪2-远-微笑" duration="3" reversex="true" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <text>
        <p>Two brutish men approached from the left. </p>
        <p>One of them was the man who first discovered the girl and gave the warning.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>He was holding a sword in his hand and was beaming.</p>
        <p>Just like a hunter watching its prey falling into a trap, his smile was telling death. </p>
      </text>
      <text>But the girl wasn’t afraid. </text>
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="thick" />
      <motion chara="099" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="095" action="hide" />
      <text>She gazed towards her right.</text>
      <text>(Three)</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <se id="01-19男性沙漠疾行_03" />
      <motion chara="099" action="show" pos="right" duration="3" img="山贼4号中景" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <text>
        <p>The big guy on the right side wasn't in the girl’s line of sight at all.</p>
        <p>He ran in after hearing the warning sound.</p>
      </text>
      <text>(Four)</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="094" action="show" pos="-200,0" duration="3" img="砂匪1-近-坏笑" reversex="true" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <text>The nearest bandit was only about five steps away from Sushang.</text>
      <text>He was a muscular man with a greatsword. Among the four, he was the eldest and the most experienced in martial arts.</text>
      <motion chara="099" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="094" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.3" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="right" custom="default" />
      <bg img="BGDesert01" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-专注-持剑-远景" />
      <text>...the girl had only trained against her master, and had no actual combat experience.</text>
      <text>If she did, she would’ve known that no matter how strong martial artists are, they should try their best to avoid a situation where there’s more than one enemy. </text>
      <text>And fighting alone against four well trained sand bandits is no different from cutting one's own throat.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-浅笑-持剑-远景" />
      <text>Unfortunately, the girl didn’t know this common knowledge, and her reclusive Master would be even more clueless. </text>
      <text>Thus she wasn’t afraid, but excited.</text>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="传奇诞生" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>——The sand bandits were only five steps away from her.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0.1" stop="0.1" out="0.1" color="#FFFFFF" />
      <se id="01-20拿出轩辕剑" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.2" range="20" direction="horizontal" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" img="素裳-浅笑-背剑-远景" duration="0.6" pos="center" />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono inline="true">
        <p />
        <p>The girl shook her cloth bag, and drew the ancient sword 『Xuanyuan』 from behind her back.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <cg scale="2.7" origin="75%,10%" img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-1" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <cg img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-1" scale="2.7" origin="75%,10%" duration="5" pos="260,0" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>The feeling of having a sword in hand always made her feel at ease.</p>
      </mono>
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <cg pos="260,0" scale="2.7" origin="75%,10%" img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-2" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p>What happened next,</p>
        <p />
        <p>was supposed to be like this:</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="move" in="0.2" stop="1" out="1" color="#000000" direction="right" custom="default" />
      <cg />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <se id="01-22女孩轻功whoosh_01" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="速度线左右1" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The girl leaped forward, her body astonishingly graceful.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <transition mode="dissolve" in="0.1" stop="0.1" out="0.1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="BGBlood1" />
      <se id="01-02大剑命中" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="60" direction="default" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>When she landed, she thrusted her sword into the brute's chest. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono inline="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>She drew out the sword and turned around —— the movement was so fast that the blood hadn't gushed out yet.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-02大剑命中" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="60" direction="vertical" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Then she held out the sword and watched the ferocious smile forming on the man's face.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>There were only two of the four enemies left —— easy.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="dissolve" in="3" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-标准-持剑-远景" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <text>… The girl had conceived this script in an instant.</text>
      <text>
        <p>With her martial arts accomplishments and the benefits of the ancient sword, Xuanyuan——</p>
        <p>——Turning this scenario from fantasy to reality would be too easy. </p>
      </text>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>——The Sand bandits were only four steps away.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-专注-持剑-远景" />
      <text>But the girl didn’t move.</text>
      <text>… Not worth it.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <se id="01-21轩辕剑氛围声" looptimes="-1" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <text inline="true">The ancient Xuanyuan Sword wasn’t a weapon used for dealing with these foes. </text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>The four people in front of her, didn’t even deserve to lay their eyes on the true face of the sword. </p>
      </text>
      <cg img="氛围_通用_轩辕剑" />
      <text>
        <p>This sword had been handed down since ancient times when the human and gods crossed the heavens, and it had gone through tens of thousands of years.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Its owner was the legend of martial arts, the only true Celestial and the Guardian of Shenzhou, 『Empyrea Phoenix』.</p>
      </text>
      <text>Twenty-nine years ago, Empyrea Phoenix received an orphan girl as her last disciple in the East Seas, and gifted her this sword.</text>
      <text>
        <p>The Seventh Sword of Taixuan, 『Ebonstyle』 Qin Suyi, shook the Jianghu society.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>After the real Celestial returned to the heavens, Qin Suyi disappeared, and resurfaced to the Jianghu Society three years later. The romantic love story between her and Li Shen, "Young Marquis of Sichuan", had been passed down for a while.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Ten years ago, her mother who had retired from the Jianghu Society gave『Ebonstyle』to the young Sushang, along with「the expectations of realizing the Five Essences of Taixuan and becoming 『#1 in the Martial world』.」</p>
      </text>
      <text inline="true">This was an unparalleled magic weapon, its blade was only for the strong.</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>How could she let the blood of the mediocre group of people in front of her contaminate the prestige of this sword?</p>
      </text>
      <se looptimes="0" id="01-21轩辕剑氛围声" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>——The Sand bandits were only three steps away.</p>
      </mono>
      <bgm id="传奇诞生" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-专注-持剑-远景" />
      <text>Small pride and contentment filled the girl’s heart.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-算计-持剑-远景" />
      <text>Ha, These guys——</text>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>——Only two steps away.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-浅笑-持剑-远景" />
      <text>——Aren’t even worthy of being my trial opponents!</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <event action="goto" to="04" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="04" type="block" prev="03" title="戦闘2">
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>﻿One step!</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="move" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <mono pageend="true">For a warrior: within a single step is the distance to fight for one’s life. </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2.5" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="男子举刀" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" delay="2.3" />
      <delay t="2.5" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <bg img="男子举刀2" />
      <mono pageend="true">The brute swung his greatsword and was about to chop off the little girl’s head, but he saw a flash of a shadow. </mono>
      <se id="01-22女孩轻功whoosh_01" />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.1" stop="0.1" out="0.1" color="#FFFFFF" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="50" direction="horizontal" looptimes="1" />
      <mono pageend="true">……The girl disappeared. </mono>
      <motion action="show" pos="center" chara="094" img="砂匪-大叫-远景" />
      <dialog chara="094">「-What?!」</dialog>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p>He instinctively looked down,</p>
        <p />
        <p>only to suddenly feel pain on his left calf;</p>
      </mono>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <motion chara="094" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <bg duration="0.1" img="BGBlood1" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <se id="01-23腿部命中" />
      <bg duration="0.1" scale="4" img="BGBlood1" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <bg duration="0.1" img="PureBlack" />
      <motion chara="094" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="40" direction="default" />
      <motion chara="094" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <se id="01-24-1男空中旋转" looptimes="-1" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="0" stop="0.1" out="3" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="氛围_第一折_烈阳2" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>The brute was just looking down at the ground, but he saw the sun instead of the ground. </p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-24-2男空中旋转衣服" />
      <mono chara="094" pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>(How did…)</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>He hadn't realized that he was kicked into the air, and that something cool poked him on his temple.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-24-1男空中旋转" looptimes="0" />
      <se id="01-31颈部命中" />
      <transition mode="halo" in="0.1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>——The sun was swallowed by darkness.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="竹林伏兵" />
      <bg img="BGDesert02" />
      <mono>When he was in the air, the brute had fainted.</mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>From the flashing of the greatsword, to kicking the brute with surprising strength, and then knocking him out with a finger. It only took Sushang less than a blink of an eye.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="0.1" />
      <cg img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-1" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono>
        <p>Her spirit has been focused like never before.</p>
        <p />
        <p>In addition to knocking down the enemy in front of her, there was no more thought in Sushang's mind.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>It was the「Blade Mantra」of the Five Essences of Edge of Taixuan.</p>
        <p />
        <p>The foundational Essence, yet it was also the most difficult Essence to master. </p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <cg />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>『Blade Mantra - Still Water』!</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <bgm id="竹林伏兵" />
      <bg img="BGDesert02" />
      <motion chara="095" action="show" pos="left" img="砂匪2-中-普通" reversex="true" />
      <dialog chara="095">「※!」 </dialog>
      <text>The man took a step late, but Rong’s body blocked and luckily separated him from the girl. </text>
      <motion chara="094" action="show" pos="right" img="山贼4号近景" />
      <motion chara="099" action="show" pos="center" img="山贼3号中景" />
      <text>The three remaining people quickly readjusted their formation. </text>
      <motion chara="095" action="img_trans" img="砂匪2-中-微笑" reversex="true" />
      <dialog chara="095">「This girl is a trained fighter!」</dialog>
      <text>The other two remained silent.</text>
      <text>
        <p>There was no answer from either side.</p>
        <p>The experienced Sand bandits didn’t care about this, because in their eyes, the girl was already a dying person.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="099" action="hide" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="094" action="hide" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="095" action="hide" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="right" custom="default" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono inline="true">At the other end, Sushang laid on the sand, suddenly jumped in a split second, </mono>
      <se id="01-25沙子飞溅" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="砂石如瀑" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" delay="0.8" />
      <bg img="飞沙走石2" />
      <mono>her left foot kicked the sand towards the men, arousing the sand and rocks like a waterfall.</mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Use sand to cover the enemy’s sight in exchange for a valuable time advantage.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Use every point of the venue factor to maximize the possibility of winning.</p>
        <p />
        <p>This was Sushang's way of thinking. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>But this was also what the enemy expected.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Due to many years in the Northern Desert, the bandits have long been familiar with this style of tricks. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>It’s better to say that they were the most proficient in these same tactics.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Girl kicked up the sand, which was not surprise, as the enemies they faced in the past always did the same.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>But if she thought they would be in a hurry because of this, then she was underestimating the Sand bandits.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="3" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="氛围_第一折_金沙帮众" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>——The「Golden Sand Gang」of the Northern Desert has been operating on Shenzhou, Ingush, and Bahai’s border for over six years. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>What they did was the work of bandits: robbing caravans that went to and from countries, snatching precious goods, killing men and old people, and selling women and children into slavery.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>But compared to other bandits, the Sand bandits were more disciplined.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <bg img="沙漠之鹰" />
      <cg />
      <delay t="1" />
      <bgm id="传奇诞生" />
      <text>
        <p>Legend has it that the leader of the Golden Sand Gang,「Eagle」, was of military background.</p>
        <p>However, he was relegated for unjust crimes, and the whole clan was implicated.</p>
      </text>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-悲伤-扭头-远景" />
      <text>「Eagle」came to the Northern Desert and out of rage, became a bandit, and joined the gang. </text>
      <text>It only took him a day, a knife and an intelligent mind to ascend the position of the leader.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-狞笑-扭头-远景" />
      <text>No one dared to mention the name of the previous bandit leader since then.</text>
      <notification>Biography unlocked：「Eagle」</notification>
      <event action="achievement" aid="c6045ef06bed0a3f" />
      <text>
        <p>The gang feared「Eagle」because he was ruthless; </p>
        <p>The gang respected「Eagle」, because he always won and was undefeated.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>After becoming the new boss, he brought about earth-shaking changes to the Golden Sand Gang. </p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>The gang went from former bandits to becoming a small disciplined group, the overlord of the land along the border of the Northern Desert.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" img="老鹰-普通-玩玉-远景" />
      <text>
        <p>The bandits must have practiced martial arts at one point or another, and practiced diligently. </p>
        <p>After martial arts training was completed, they were trained in military arts.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>「Eagle」tirelessly taught formation, changes, coordination, and various signals and commands. </p>
        <p>What「Eagle」wanted was not a sloppy bandit group, but an army.</p>
      </text>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <event action="goto" to="05" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="05" type="block" prev="04" title="戦闘3">
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="原始武士" />
      <bg img="BGDesert02" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-笑-普通-远景" />
      <text>Because of this, when the three of them faced the strange girl in front of them, they didn’t even look down on her.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" delay="1" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-普通-单举刀-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[The enemy is the enemy. There is no distinction between men and women, old or young, only you. Anyone can take your life. Treat the target as the last opponent in your life and use all means to kill them.]  </dialog>
      <text>Eagle warned them repeatedly.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="BGDesert02" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-笑-普通-远景" />
      <text>Therefore, the three of them didn’t panic at all when they saw that their companion was knocked out.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" delay="1" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-普通-抱胸有刀-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[You must protect your companions on the battlefield, but fallen companions are not comrades in arms, but burdens. Don’t treat them as standing people. Only soldiers who know when to give them up can live longer.] </dialog>
      <text>Eagle reminded them repeatedly.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="BGDesert02" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-笑-普通-远景" />
      <text>Similarly, the three of them didn’t hesitate after seeing Sushang had kicked up a sand storm into the sky.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" delay="1" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-微笑-持刀-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[Follow my plan, and everything will be fine.]</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>This was the guarantee of "Eagle". </p>
        <p>They believe in "Eagle".</p>
      </text>
      <text>After all, for five years, "Eagle"’s instructions have never been wrong.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <text>Not once.</text>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>The three quickly closed their eyes.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Compared with the loss of vision, the pain and conditioned reflexes caused by sand in the eyes were more dangerous.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>The moment they closed their eyes, the three had already memorized each other's and the enemy's location.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The steps they took next and the direction of their swords strictly followed the “Cormorant Wings Formation”. </p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-26大刀向下挥" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="竖劈" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" delay="0.4" />
      <bg img="竖劈1-黑底" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The bandit in the center took the lead with a greatsword, launching a heavy strike from above.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-27大刀横挥" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="横劈" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" delay="0.2" />
      <bg img="横劈1-黑底" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The bandit on the left took a step, slashed horizontally, and attacked the target’s lower half.</p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The intention of these two swords was not to kill the enemy, but to bait the enemy.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-26大刀向下挥" />
      <se id="01-27大刀横挥" />
      <bg img="叠加1-黑底" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>"Eagle" carefully designed formations and swordsmanship to guide the enemy to dodge according to a pre-established route.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>If the target can dodge these two blades, then she must be in the pre-calculated position at this moment.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>At this time, it was the turn of the bandit on the right to execute a mortal blow.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>They're confident that even if they couldn’t see the enemy, they could kill the enemy with this three-man formation!</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>There was nothing wrong with the formation, but the Sands bandits underestimated Sushang.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">Underestimated her odd speed.</mono>
      <se id="01-25沙子飞溅" />
      <bg img="飞沙走石2" />
      <bgm id="火燃" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>As soon as the sand specks flew up, Sushang had already sprung forward.</p>
      </mono>
      <cg img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-2" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Just as the Sand bandits were convinced of Eagle's formation, she also had absolute confidence in her martial arts.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>With a clear Blade Heart, she didn’t feel that the slow sword technique of the big man was necessary to dodge.</p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <cg />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1.5" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="撞向胸口" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" delay="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <se id="01-28胸口命中" />
      <delay t="0.4" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>When the middle swordsman raised the greatsword, the girl was already within arms reach.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1.2" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="击打下颚" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="40" direction="vertical" delay="0.2" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" delay="1" />
      <delay t="0.6" />
      <se id="01-29下颚命中" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Before he even had time to react, he received a heavy blow on the lower jaw.</p>
        <p />
        <p>The impact passed through his skull directly to the brain. The violent concussion immediately made him faint.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="30" direction="default" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Therefore, the swordsman failed to feel the heavy kick that hit his knee afterwards, and collapsed to the ground.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="飞燕归巢" />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <se id="01-30女孩轻功whoosh_02" />
      <delay t="0.9" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>With the help of a kick, Sushang made a beautiful "Swallow’s Return", and in a flash, she landed behind the big man on the left.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0.1" stop="0.1" out="0.1" color="#000000" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="49" direction="default" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="击打后颈" />
      <se id="01-31颈部命中" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="50" direction="default" delay="0.2" />
      <mono inline="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>She hit the back of the big man with her palm,</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-32铁剑掷出" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" img="速度线左右1" pos="center" />
      <mono pageend="true">grabbed the sword with the other hand, and threw it at the last enemy.</mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>In an instant, she calculated the strength and speed to the right, and put it into action correctly.</p>
      </mono>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The "Blade Mantra" of Taixuan’s Five Essences</p>
        <p>It was just such a profound mental method that maximizes the potential of the brain.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="氛围_第一折_烈阳" />
      <se id="01-33男气声受击" />
      <remark>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>『Swordsmanship』:</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>It was one of the parts that made up swords.</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>The core of the sword was a kensen (sword spinal cord) at its center, and on either side were two sides.</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>Sword spinal cord and sword back are combined to form a kenja.</p>
      </remark>
      <text>Sushang accurately hit the man's abdominal cavity with the sword, the sudden pain made him open his mouth and let out a short hiss.</text>
      <bg img="氛围_第一折_烈阳2" duration="0.3" />
      <text>At this moment, the world was spinning, and the sense of balance disappeared instantly.</text>
      <se id="01-34男沙地重摔" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.5" out="3" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="佛心禅悟" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_李素裳1" />
      <text>Something hot was on his right cheek and it was too hot for him to bear.</text>
      <text>The man opened his eyes and saw the hot sand that was almost jet black.</text>
      <text>It turned out that something was not pressing against his cheeks, but his face was pressed tightly against the ground.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[...You guys are a little bit scarce.]</dialog>
      <text>Sushang sat on his back, tapping the back of his head with her slender fingers:</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Why are there only four of you? Where did the others go?]</dialog>
      <text>Her voice was clear and crisp, very nice, like an innocent girl.</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_李素裳2" duration="1" />
      <dialog chara="002">[I want to hear the truth.]</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="4" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="3" stop="0.6" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="06" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="06" prev="05" title="待ち伏せ">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>At this moment, hundreds of miles away… </p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="氛围_第一折_烈阳" />
      <se id="01-35炎热沙漠环境" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>A man laid on the golden sand, unable to move. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Beads of sweat emerged all over his body, making him itchy. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>But he was motionless. </p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2.5" />
      <bgm id="神秘东方" />
      <bg img="BGDesert02" duration="3" />
      <delay t="2.5" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Even through clothes, the sand was so hot to the touch, it was burning his skin. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The man tried his best to focus, so he wouldn’t faint from all the heat and pain. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>At this time, he always remembered what the「Eagle」 once said:</p>
        <p>If people like them were caught by imperial officers and soldiers, their chests would be branded with a red branding iron.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>A branding iron was harder than sand and hotter than the sun. Once it touches the skin, it will melt a layer of skin and leave a brand.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>That feeling,「Eagle」said: it's like going to hell.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2.5" />
      <bg img="BGDesert00" duration="3" />
      <delay t="2.5" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Golden Sand gang members often speaked of hell, after all they were destined to meet again there.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Hell is a scary place and it’s boring; there’s no gold or silver, no good wine, no beautiful women.</p>
        <p>You couldn’t name a single good thing there</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>But here, as long as they succeed in today's raid, they will have whatever they want.</p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="BGDesert02" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>This caravan was said to be larger than ones before, and the「Eagle」had received absolutely reliable information. </p>
        <p />
        <p>The caravan from far away brought the families of the rich and nobles, and the car was full of gold and silver treasures.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>If the information was correct, in 30 minutes, all of these would belong to them. </p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="BGDesert01" />
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <text>Thinking of it, he couldn't help but lift his head slightly, looking out of the corner of his eyes to the only man standing.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" duration="3" img="老鹰-普通-普通有刀-远景" />
      <bgm id="传奇诞生" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <text>The man looked to be in his 40s, with white streaks of hair, wrinkles, and scars on his face written with hatred.</text>
      <text>
        <p>He was actually younger, but not too young. Looking at the whole face at a glance, only the eyes stood out: those were the eyes of an eagle.</p>
        <p>He looked into the distance, as if hunting for his prey.</p>
      </text>
      <text>He was just waiting for the upcoming prey, and the ambushing Golden Sand Gang were his minions.</text>
      <text>「Eagle」—— that was his nickname, an honorific of respect and fear.</text>
      <text>As long as it was an order from「Eagle」, even if the Golden Sand Gang was to lie on scorching sand for an hour, they would follow it.</text>
      <text>
        <p>There was no need to question, no promises,</p>
        <p>As long as you follow the instructions of「Eagle」, the exchange will be——</p>
      </text>
      <text>——「Victory」.</text>
      <transition mode="eye" in="0.5" stop="0.3" out="0.5" color="#000000" />
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-微笑-抱胸有刀-远景" />
      <text>
        <p>Suddenly, a smile appeared on Eagle’s face,</p>
        <p>His eyes changed accordingly. </p>
      </text>
      <text>Those pair of eyes stopped watching, they turned, and slowly turned around—— this was a signal to hunt.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" duration="2" />
      <text>「Eagle」raised his hand, took a step back, and then took another step back.</text>
      <text>He was withdrawing from the sight of the caravan's guards, and his hand gesture was the signal to attack.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <bg img="BGDesert00" duration="3" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The man on the sand looked forward again and gave a sigh of relief. Though the heated air was roasting his lungs, he didn’t mind. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Far away, dust was rising. </p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-36骆驼车队loop" looptimes="-1" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <bg img="远处的烟尘" duration="3" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <event action="show_ui" />
      <mono chara="-1">
        <p />
        <p>「It’s coming.」</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Someone whispered.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>The men who had been in ambush for a long time were relieved, the most difficult stage had passed. </p>
        <p />
        <p>From here on, there was only victory. And this victory……</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Was something they’ve been waiting for a long time.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-36骆驼车队loop" looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="2" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="3" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <dialog chara="099">???: 「……」</dialog>
      <cg img="氛围_通用_棺材" duration="2" />
      <se id="01-37棺材氛围声loop" looptimes="-1" />
      <text>In one of the caravan carriages not far away, a coffin stood quietly.</text>
      <cg />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <cg img="氛围_通用_棺材" scale="2" origin="50%,0%" duration="0" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <cg img="氛围_通用_棺材" duration="20" pos="0,-520" scale="2" origin="50%,0%" />
      <text>It is about the height of an average person, the wood is brightly painted with white lacquer, and it was carved with ornate decorations.</text>
      <text>
        <p>From the outside, the coffin was completely sealed with no gaps present.</p>
        <p>Several black leather straps were wrapped around the body of the coffin and bound it firmly.</p>
      </text>
      <text>It seems that the owner of this coffin had spent a lot of effort to completely isolate the contents inside it from the outside world……</text>
      <cg duration="3" />
      <delay t="1.5" />
      <motion chara="001" action="show" pos="center" duration="3" img="奥托-悲伤-标准-近景" delay="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>That owner was in front of it at the moment.</text>
      <text>
        <p>A man with blond hair and green eyes knelt next to the coffin on one knee, sliding his slender fingers across the coffin's surface.</p>
        <p>His movements were as soft as if caressing, but as if he had exhausted all his strength.</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="099">???: 「……」</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>This person made the coffin with his own hands, so that the contents of the coffin were isolated from the world.</p>
        <p>It was this person who fought against the laws of the world, just to bring his beloved back to the present world. </p>
        <p>Before his wish was fulfilled, he couldn't throw himself away from the world.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>So, among the roars, shouts, and crying from afar;</p>
        <p>among the wailing of camels, the overturning of carriages, the slashing of swords——</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>——The man was motionless, unconsciously.</p>
        <p>It seemed that everything except this coffin had nothing to do with him.</p>
      </text>
      <text>It had nothing to do with him……</text>
      <motion chara="001" action="hide" delay="3" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="3" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <se id="01-37棺材氛围声loop" looptimes="0" />
      <cg />
      <event action="goto" to="07" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="07" prev="06" title="圧勝">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="2" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="远处的烟尘" />
      <se id="01-36骆驼车队loop" looptimes="-1" />
      <text>Huh, huh, huh, huh…</text>
      <text>
        <p>The hooves sounded again, and the wheels rolled forward. </p>
        <p>Men with swords and greatswords flocked around, guarding the men, horses, gold and silver of the caravan.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Nothing seemed to have changed, everything was completely overturned: </p>
        <p>The merchants have been reduced to slaves, and the robbers have become their masters.</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="move" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <bg img="BGDesert01" />
      <se />
      <se id="01-38踏在沙上的脚步声" />
      <text>Boots stepped on the warm sand, and a faint warmth came from the soles of the feet.</text>
      <remark>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>Note：</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>Raksha country located in the severely cold region to the north of Shenzhou and often invades Shenzhou's borders.</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>Rakshans have distinctive facial features, many have light-colored hair and blue eyes. Some are as beautiful as gods, while others are as ugly as demons.</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>Shenzhou people of that time called those with unusual appearances Rakshans, sometimes in a discriminatory sense.</p>
      </remark>
      <text>The place you step on will always sink slightly, causing the center of gravity to shake, as if being gently pulled by the earth. For「Eagle」, this feeling always reminded him of the blood-soaked snow in the Raksha Kingdom.</text>
      <text>「Eagle」hates snow.</text>
      <bgm id="神秘东方" />
      <motion action="show" pos="center" chara="015" img="老鹰-普通-普通有刀-远景" duration="2" />
      <text>「Eagle」who had won a big victory was expressionless, his gloominess was like a barrier, forming a field centered on him: outside this was the joyous sand bandits, and inside was muddy silence.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <bg img="远处的烟尘" duration="2" />
      <delay t="1.5" />
      <text>He should have been in a very good mood, but today's raid was really too beautiful and too successful.</text>
      <text>The seized silver commodities are worth tens of thousands, and even if they change hands quickly, they could make a net profit of seven or eight thousand taels of silver.</text>
      <text>There were nine middle-aged men and women captives, of which there were quite a few high-class goods, and the slave traders who waited for a hundred times to pass by were also a lot of money.</text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <cg img="氛围_第一折_金沙帮众" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>But the most gratifying thing was the performance of his gang brethren.</p>
        <p />
        <p>It was totally different from the decadence when he first took over the Golden Sand Gang.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono inline="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Although the caravan was in an ambush this time, the bodyguards did their best;</p>
        <p />
        <p>after a moment of panic, they quickly regrouped their soldiers and launched a tenacious resistance. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>——But this is what「Eagle」expected. </p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="BGBlood1" />
      <cg />
      <text>「Eagle」likes opponents to resist.</text>
      <text>
        <p>He was precisely the kind of person who finds pleasure and the meaning of existence from challenge.</p>
        <p>The more fierce the opponent's resistance, the higher the value of training.</p>
        <p>The meaning of victory was to bring the highest satisfaction in the ever-increasing value——</p>
      </text>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="dissolve" in="1" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="BGSky02" />
      <bgm id="余烬" />
      <mono>——In the white snow of the Northern Lands, he once believed that this kind of satisfaction had reached its peak.</mono>
      <mono>——He tried his best to escape from the place where his father, brother and his comrades died, and he used politics as a new battlefield, thinking that he would still be able to conquer the situation.</mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>——After being wronged and imprisoned, the new "comrade-in-arms" abandoned him. It was not the pain and regret that made him wake up countless times from his dreams, but the time spent fighting with the Raksha demons.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">——Those who saved his life to rescue him from the dispatched army, were the loyal subordinates who had been left behind by him.</mono>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <text>Ever since then,「Eagle」finally understood that his life would stay forever in that long war.</text>
      <remark>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>注：</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>羅刹国は神州北方の酷寒の地にあり、よく神州の国境に侵攻し、戦争を起こす。</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>羅刹人は独特な顔立ちをしており、その多くは髪の毛の色が薄く、碧眼である。神様のように美しい者もいれば、悪鬼のように醜い者もいる。</p>
        <p>ㅤ</p>
        <p>当時の神州人は一際変わった容貌をした者を、差別的な意味を含めて羅刹人と呼んだ。</p>
      </remark>
      <text>
        <p>The moment he left the Raksha Kingdom, his life had stagnated. </p>
        <p>The rest of the time was just a walking corpse repeating its worthless actions.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>That’s why he fled to the Northern Desert, captured the Golden Sand Gang, and got a group of loyal soldiers.</p>
        <p>So he tempered, spurred, and tortured them;</p>
        <p>sent them to death and live with them.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Repeating the past,</p>
        <p>avenging the past,</p>
        <p>yearning for the past.</p>
      </text>
      <text>The man named「Eagle」wants to move the time that has stopped……</text>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <event action="goto" to="08" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="08" prev="07" title="生殺">
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="BGDesert00" />
      <text>
        <p>Therefore, when meeting the Raksha,</p>
        <p>the「Eagle」suddenly had the illusion of time recurring.</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="clock" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <bgm id="神秘东方" />
      <text>
        <p>At first sight of this person, the「Eagle」's back went abruptly cold, </p>
        <p>The alarm bell sounded instinctively, telling him that this was a 「scourge」.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>At the time,「Scourge」stayed in the caravan's carriage and enjoyed a small cabin exclusively.</p>
        <p>Among the dozens of caravans, he is the only one who had this extraordinary treatment.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="4" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场1" duration="5" />
      <delay t="4" />
      <text>When「Eagle」's sword brushed up the screen, Raksha was talking to something.</text>
      <dialog chara="001">Raksha:「Mach dir keine sorgen」(Don't worry)</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>The man knelt on one knee. His tone was calm and easy-going, as if he was asking a close travel companion, but he looked around:</p>
        <p>There was no one else in the compartment, only a coffin.</p>
      </text>
      <text>Only him, and a coffin.</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场2" />
      <dialog chara="001">Raksha:「Ich werde lösen」(I'll resolve.)</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>This person wasn't speaking in Raksha language,「Eagle」couldn't understand it.</p>
        <p>But this strange and terrifying scene had him sweating bullets.</p>
      </text>
      <text>He couldn't help but look up at the weird man who was talking to the coffin:</text>
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场2" scale="3" origin="40%,80%" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场2" scale="3" pos="0,500" origin="45%,80%" duration="30" />
      <text>
        <p>The Raksha person was about twenty years old, tall and not strong looking.</p>
        <p>He obviously had some skills, but he was definitely not a master.</p>
      </text>
      <text>Just by observing his appearance and shape, you can know a little about how martial arts a person has.</text>
      <text>
        <p>If you have bulging muscles, you are a martial artist who practices Waijiaquan.</p>
        <p>This type of manpower sinks his shoulders and arms, strikes fists and feet that can break gold and gravel, and it was no problem to resist ordinary blunt weapons.</p>
      </text>
      <text>But the「Eagle」doesn't see this kind of person in their eyes.</text>
      <text>
        <p>The smart foreign kung fu emphasizes balance and permeates the whole body. Blindly insisting on fierce effort has lost flexibility.</p>
        <p>A person of both speed and strength, Fang is a middle-to-higher person.</p>
      </text>
      <text>The master of the inner family has another set of tricks.</text>
      <text>
        <p>Inner Kung fu exercises inner strength, that is, meridians and 「Zhen Qi」.</p>
        <p>This kind of person is introverted in appearance, and appears everywhere. Observe the expression in his eyes and listen to the expressions, and you can know the depth.</p>
      </text>
      <text>Needless to say, the「Eagle」glanced away, and it was known that this Raksha man's outside martial arts could be described as mediocre; from his chaotic breathing rhythm, he also knew that this man had never learned superior internal skills.</text>
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <cg />
      <bg img="BGDesert02" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-专注-拔刀预备-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">Eagle:「Come out.」</dialog>
      <text>「Eagle」 said, his hand dropped on the handle of the scimitar.</text>
      <text>The Raksha hates him the most, and it is even more unlucky to hit the coffin in the daytime. The two taboos merge into one, and the 「Eagle」 has an impulse to sacrifice blood.</text>
      <text>
        <p>He was already full of blood debts, so why not add another life?</p>
        <p>But... the scimitar was not out of its sheath.</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="move" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场1" scale="3" origin="40%,10%" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <text inline="true">The Raksha sighed, then whispered a few words to the coffin, </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="4" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场1" scale="3" origin="40%,10%" duration="4" pos="-205,0" />
      <delay t="4" />
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>and then glanced at the leader of the gang.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场2" scale="3" origin="56%,10%" duration="2" />
      <delay t="1.5" />
      <text>His eyes are green like jade, like two carefully polished emeralds.</text>
      <dialog chara="015">Eagle:「……」</dialog>
      <text>Somehow, the intuition called "sharp" sounded in my heart again.</text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场2" />
      <text>The people of Raksha calmly asked in a lame but clear Chinese dialect:</text>
      <dialog chara="001">Raksha:「Arrive?」</dialog>
      <text>This question had no background and was too inexplicable, but the 「Eagle」 nodded.</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场1" />
      <text>The Raksha man pointedly:</text>
      <dialog chara="001">Raksha:「Here, yours?」</dialog>
      <dialog chara="015">「Eagle」:「This is mine, and you are mine. Come out .」</dialog>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场1" />
      <dialog chara="001">Raksha:「Well……」</dialog>
      <text>The Raksha didn't say anything, but slowly stretched out, struggling to support his knees with his hands, as if to get up.</text>
      <text>
        <p>[em italic]The Raksha with a pose.[/em]</p>
        <p>「Eagle」couldn't help cursing in his heart. </p>
        <p>[em italic]When a hundred times people buy you away, it depends on how you look.[/em]</p>
      </text>
      <text>He suddenly missed the past. If ten years ago, he would have already taken the scimitar out and chopped off this beautiful head. </text>
      <text>
        <p>Dead Rakshas are worthless, but the living Rakshas are rare goods.</p>
        <p>A hundred slave traders prefer this bite, and they can always give a good price.</p>
      </text>
      <text>「Eagle」looked at the obedient Raksha, suddenly a little curious.</text>
      <text>
        <p>Why did he speak to the coffin?</p>
        <p>This person occupies a whole room alone, mysterious...</p>
        <p>Yes, he doesn't want people to know what was in the coffin.</p>
      </text>
      <text>Then…… what's in it?</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>……What would it be? ?</p>
      </text>
      <cg />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1.1" />
      <motion chara="001" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-专注-拔刀预备-中景" reversex="true" />
      <se id="01-27大刀横挥" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="横劈1-透明" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" delay="0.3" />
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-狞笑-拔刀-中景" reversex="true" />
      <delay t="0.3" />
      <text>The scimitar flashed and landed on the Raksha's neck. 「Eagle」 pointed at the coffin in front of him:</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-微笑-单举刀-中景" reversex="true" />
      <dialog chara="015">「Eagle」:「Open.」</dialog>
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.3" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场2" />
      <text>He gave a simple order and got an unexpected answer.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2.5" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场3" duration="3" />
      <delay t="2.5" />
      <dialog chara="001">Raksha:「Do not.」</dialog>
      <text>The deep green eyes glanced at him very slowly.</text>
      <dialog chara="015">「Eagle」:「——!」</dialog>
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <text>
        <p>「Eagle」has seen countless people in his life,</p>
        <p>And the eyes he has seen are countless.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Fear, hatred, anger, unwillingness, pain…… </p>
        <p>He has not only seen it, but was often the source of all these emotions.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>A blade on a neck is the best Verita serum in the world, </p>
        <p>it can completely expose a person's deepest heart.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>The「Eagle」was numb to his dying eyes, </p>
        <p>and was indifferent to his dying emotions.</p>
        <p>He had seen too many of those.</p>
      </text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场3" scale="4" origin="50%,20%" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托出场3" scale="4" duration="10" pos="-100,100" origin="50%,20%" />
      <text>
        <p>However, there had never been a look like the one in the eyes of this Raksha, </p>
        <p>Mixed with determination, madness, cruelty, pleasure, compassion and...</p>
      </text>
      <text>[em bold]…… Contempt[/em] ?</text>
      <cg />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-心虚-单举刀-近景" />
      <text>
        <p>[em italic]Is that.[/em]</p>
        <p>「Eagle」gave a chuckle in his heart and swallowed and spit.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>This Raksha man didn't see him in his eyes at all.</p>
        <p>In the eyes of this person, the「Eagle」, leader of the Golden Sand Gang , was no different than a grain of sand in the desert.</p>
        <p>It had neither value nor meaning.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>He even had the illusion that in the next second, the Rakshas would walk over this grain of sand,</p>
        <p>And it would be as natural as a stroll.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-恐惧-普通NO刀-近景" duration="1" />
      <text>So he put down the scimitar.</text>
      <text>
        <p>Not afraid,「Eagle」told himself:</p>
        <p>He would never be afraid of a Raksha.</p>
      </text>
      <text>But the emotion in his heart made him more ashamed than fear, and made him want to run away from the person in front of him.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-普通-普通NO刀-近景" />
      <dialog chara="015">「Eagle」:「……Follow us, don't play tricks.」</dialog>
      <text>Leaving this sentence aside,「Eagle」turned and walked away.</text>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <event action="achievement" aid="4ce232f70dd2d920" />
      <transition mode="clock" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="BGDesert_Smoke" />
      <bgm id="竹林伏兵" />
      <text>
        <p>In the distance, a wisp of smoke rose slowly.</p>
        <p>This is the signal to guide the Golden Sand Gang’s return journey.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="5.5" />
      <bg img="BGDesert02" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <bg img="沙漠驿站" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <bg duration="2" img="BGDesert01" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="left" img="老鹰-悲伤-扭头-远景" reversex="true" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <motion chara="095" action="show" pos="right" duration="1" img="砂匪2-远-惊慌" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <dialog chara="095">man:「What--」</dialog>
      <motion chara="095" action="img_trans" img="砂匪2-远-微笑" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <dialog chara="095">man:「Leader!」</dialog>
      <dialog chara="015">「Eagle」:「……Thanks for your hard work.」</dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="move" pos="center" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" delay="0.5" />
      <text>「Eagle」 was full of thought and didn’t say much to them, and went straight into the post</text>
      <motion chara="095" action="move" pos="left" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <motion chara="095" action="img_trans" reversex="true" img="砂匪2-远-普通" />
      <motion chara="094" action="show" pos="right" img="砂匪1-远-普通" />
      <text>The sand bandits who guarded the house exchanged glances and breathed a sigh of relief at the same time.</text>
      <dialog chara="095">man:「Call……」</dialog>
      <text>But before this breath reached his throat, a majestic voice rang in his ears:</text>
      <motion chara="094" action="move" pos="-200,0" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="094" action="img_trans" reversex="true" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="right" img="老鹰-普通-抱胸有刀-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">「Eagle」:「……When I was on the expedition,」</dialog>
      <text>The leader of the Golden Sand Gang put his arms around his chest, his eyes as sharp as an eagle.</text>
      <dialog chara="015">「Eagle」:「What's the situation at home?」</dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-悲伤-扭头-远景" />
      <text>
        <p>He looked up and down at the two people in front of him,</p>
        <p>glanced at the sand not far away,</p>
        <p>and cast a meaningful look at the station.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" duration="1" img="老鹰-狞笑-扭头-远景" />
      <text>The「Eagle」showed an unpleasant smile.</text>
      <dialog chara="015">「Eagle」:「……It seems to be there.」</dialog>
      <transition mode="fade" in="3" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="09" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="09" prev="08" title="地下牢">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <text>Li Sushang had originally made up her mind to stay until late at night without making any noise. </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1.5" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-欸真的吗-普通-近景" duration="2" />
      <delay t="1.5" />
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「……Will the plan go smoothly?」</dialog>
      <text>Before a single incense of time has run out, she couldn’t help murmuring to herself, breaking the previous deal cleanly. </text>
      <bgm id="佛心禅悟" />
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="clock" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <text>Thinking back, this whole deal was just a spur of the moment thing. </text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_李素裳1" />
      <text>An hour ago, Li Sushang defeated the four guards of the Golden Sand Gang and interrogated them. </text>
      <dialog chara="002" inline="true">Li Sushang:「……A hundred and thirteen people? Coming back tonight? </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p />
        <p>It’s more than I expected, really hard to handle…」</p>
      </dialog>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_李素裳2" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>Li Sushang:「Hey, you know 「Eagle」 better than me…</p>
        <p>say, if I want to fight him one on one, would he accept it?」</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="095">Man:「Who, what kind of person are you?!?」</dialog>
      <text>He didn’t answer her question. </text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_李素裳1" />
      <dialog chara="002" inline="true">
        <p>Li Sushang: 「Aye… </p>
        <p>I’m Li Sushang, Eldest Disciple of『Wanderer’s House』.」</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p />
        <p>Don’t change the subject, you haven’t answered me yet.」</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="095">
        <p>Man:「What are you saying… Wanderer’s House… </p>
        <p>Who the hell are you?!…」</p>
      </dialog>
      <text>
        <p>The man thought what the girl said was a bunch of crazy talk.</p>
        <p>Li Sushang felt that she couldn’t communicate with this person at all, and simply ignored him.  </p>
      </text>
      <cg />
      <bg img="BGDesert01" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-专注-抱手-近景" duration="1" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>Li Sushang: (Over a hundred people, should I do it by the rules? …Too troublesome.</p>
        <p>The purpose of the trip was just to fight 「Eagle」.)</p>
      </dialog>
      <text>
        <p>Master said casually [em color=#FAFAD2]「You know the Golden Sand Gang? Go beat their boss and come back.」[/em]</p>
        <p>It was easy to say, but it gave this honest disciple a headache. </p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目下-普通-近景" />
      <text>The girl sighed and tried to come up with a plan.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「Hmmm…」</dialog>
      <text>She has very little experience, and the only things she could learn from were stories she had heard from her father, mother, and the storyteller in the village. </text>
      <text>「True Celestial」 Empyrea Phoenix……[\s] 「Willowfoil」 Lin Zhaoyu……[\s] 「Tireless Courser」 Ma Feima…… </text>
      <text>
        <p>The names that sounded thunderous in the Jianghu Society appeared one by one, and then she eliminated them one by one. </p>
        <p>These were all well-known experts, and they have never landed themselves in a predicament like her. </p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「What’s my trick…」</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>[em italic]Yan Shiluo……[/em][\s]</p>
        <p>Like a ghost, the strange Martial Arts hero from 40 years ago appeared in the girl’s mind. </p>
      </text>
      <text>She had only heard the story once, but she remembered it unexpectedly and firmly: </text>
      <text>『All the heroes of the Jianghu Society gathered at the Lotus Conference to discuss a plan to attack the Fire Cult.』</text>
      <text>『Unexpectedly Angra Atar’s Ahura Yan Shiluo was lurking in disguise, and on the day of the conference he defeated the heads of three gathering sects Shao, Lian, and Hua, set fire to the Lotus Terrace, and went away laughing.』</text>
      <text>Lurking in disguise…</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-小恶魔-普通-近景" />
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang: (Got it!)</dialog>
      <text>The girl finally concocted a worthy plan.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_李素裳1" />
      <text>Li Sushang's finger pressed lightly against the back of the man's head, with extremely soft force, but the person under her took a nervous breath.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「Hey, don't move, I won't kill you. I just want to make a deal with you.」</dialog>
      <dialog chara="095">Man: [You crazy girl… you, what do you want to do?」</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「Your leader will be back soon. If you let him know that you were beaten like this by me, he will be furious and punish you severely, right?」</dialog>
      <text>The man didn't speak, and Sushang took this as true, and went on happily.</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_李素裳2" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>Li Sushang:「I have a suggestion. Follow my plan and make sure he doesn't know anything.</p>
        <p>Go and call your companions. Let's make an agreement first…」</p>
      </dialog>
      <transition mode="shutter" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg />
      <bg img="牢房-暗" />
      <text>So, the girl「voluntarily」squatted in the Dark Dungeon.</text>
      <text>『The Dark Dungeon』was originally the cellar of this Stop. Since the Golden Sand Gang took over this place, its function hadn’t changed, except the stored items were replaced by living people instead of food. </text>
      <text>The bandits’ looted「goods」were thrown into here, and hundreds of slave merchants visited clean the dungeon and leave the equivalent worth of gold and silver. For several years, the operation of this「Stop」has been very smooth.</text>
      <text>
        <p>But to snuck into the dungeon and pretended to be「goods」uninvited,</p>
        <p>Li Sushang was probably the first one who did it.</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="clock" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="牢房-暗" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-标准-抱手-近景" />
      <text>The dungeon was dark and damp, filled with a foul scent, occasionally there were low sobbing sounds from unknown cells, sometimes there were moments of silence. </text>
      <text>
        <p>Sushang spread out a makeshift mat with only a few withered weeds,</p>
        <p>sat down properly, and recited the『Blade Mantra Swara』to pass time.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" duration="2" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The Blade Mantra Swara is the introductory mental method of『Edge of Taixuan』, </p>
        <p>It was a unique skill highly coveted by everyone in the Jianghu Society.</p>
        <p />
        <p>But unbeknownst to most, the true body of the Blade Mantra Swara were just strange and inexplicable syllables. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true" inline="true">
        <p />
        <p>The syllables are formless, they are indescribable by words;</p>
        <p>It teaches neither Ki movement, nor does it guide body training;</p>
        <p>The so-called『Blade Mantra Swara』, was absolutely meaningless.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>If you listened to the Blade Mantra Swara, you would treat it as the babble of an idiot in a dream. </p>
        <p>It was impossible to think that this was the magnificent technique that reigned on top of the martial arts in Shenzhou for thousands of years.  </p>
        <p />
        <p>As everyone knows, the mystery lies in this:</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Recitation, meditation, and listening were training of the mind.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「…Mu… talali… mu… nokulo…」</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>The words have power. </p>
        <p>Sushang may not understand it, but she did feel the transformation of her『Heart』. </p>
      </text>
      <text>With the reverberation of the words, the ups and downs of the rhythm, the Blade Mantra Swara seemed to seep through the blood, wandering in the eight strange channels of the meridian. </text>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「Mu, mali.」</dialog>
      <bg img="心湖（1）止水" duration="10" />
      <text>
        <p>The body became lighter and lighter, the mind no longer stirred.</p>
        <p>The five senses converged into a single place, in a single Heart Lake.</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「Mu, Wuliute.」</dialog>
      <text>The lake was clear and transparent, a few melancholy leaves fell on the lake surface, yet they didn’t make a ripple. </text>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「Mu, kabayisiliu.」</dialog>
      <text>The waves are calm, the water silent. It calmly reflected the existence of [Li Sushang]. </text>
      <text>
        <p>This is the first out of the four stages of the Blade Mantra</p>
        <p>-『Still Water』. </p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang: (Continue…)</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>Sushang rid herself of trivial thoughts, transforming the Blade Mantra further.</p>
        <p>Climbing the next level——</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="5" />
      <bg img="心湖（2）无尘" duration="5" />
      <delay t="4.5" />
      <text>
        <p>The Heart Lake condensed to ice,</p>
        <p>Brushing away all irrelevant thoughts, without leaving a single trace. </p>
      </text>
      <text>Second Stage -『Dustless』. </text>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang (Again…)</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="5" />
      <bg img="心湖（3）明镜" duration="5" />
      <delay t="4.5" />
      <text>
        <p>The cracks of the hard ice disappear without a trace,</p>
        <p>and the Heart Lake becomes almost infinitely transparent, its light illuminating all creations. </p>
      </text>
      <text>Third Stage -『Clear Mirror』</text>
      <text>After ten years of training, this is the stage of the [Blade Mantra] that Li Sushang has cultivated. </text>
      <text>
        <p>But above this, there is the Blade Mantra’s highest stage…</p>
        <p>Only her Master had reached the fourth stage in the world… that is…</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="5" />
      <bg img="心湖（4）太虚" duration="5" />
      <delay t="5" />
      <text>…………『Taixuan』…………</text>
      <bg img="PureBlack" duration="0" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.2" range="40" direction="default" />
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「Ah——」</dialog>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="牢房-暗" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-疲惫无神-抱手-近景" />
      <text>
        <p>The ice surface suddenly shattered, the Heart Lake dispersed, Blade Mantra had also withdrawn from her mind. </p>
        <p>Li Sushang sat there blankly, with a splitting headache, and realized her back was drenched with cold sweat. </p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-绝望张嘴-抱手-近景" />
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang: [Failed again…」</dialog>
      <text>Ever since she reached『Clear Mirror』, Sushang couldn’t make further progress with her Blade Mantra. </text>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang: […Why?」</dialog>
      <text>Mother said that Master had been a teacher since she was two, she was the earliest one to get started, so her Blade Mantra stage was the highest. </text>
      <text>
        <p>But ever since I was born, I have been hearing Mother chanting the Blade Mantra Swara day and night,</p>
        <p>so shouldn’t I progress faster than Master?</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目前-普通-近景" />
      <text>
        <p>Master realized『Taixuan』when she was only thirteen,</p>
        <p>and achieved『Eminence』at only fifteen. </p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目下-普通-近景" />
      <text>
        <p>What about me? I’m also fifteen now…</p>
        <p>I haven’t fully cultivated『Blade Mantra』yet,</p>
        <p>And I have no clue where I should start with『Blade Sanction』. </p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Even after overcoming these two peaks, </p>
        <p>There is still the essence of「Eminence」standing above them, shrouded by clouds, and wasn’t visibly real. </p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「…」</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「Aiya.」</dialog>
      <text>Li Sushang froze, then suddenly smiled. </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-大笑-抱手-近景" />
      <dialog chara="002">Li Sushang:「Master is so amazing!」</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>『Emotions』are the enemy of the『heart』. </p>
        <p>If emotions are allowed to create waves in the Heart Lake, Blade Mantra may be damaged. </p>
        <p>Sushang knew this since she has a Clear Mirror heart. </p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-笑-普通-近景" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>Li Sushang:「Don’t worry, setbacks~ they are always there.</p>
        <p>The top priority is to prepare for the sword trial!」 </p>
      </dialog>
      <text>
        <p>Li Sushang took out her cloth bag from the side. </p>
        <p>According to the plan, tonight is when the sword will be unsheathed. </p>
      </text>
      <event action="goto" to="10" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="10" type="block" prev="09" title="伝剣">
      <se id="01-20拿出轩辕剑" />
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-专注-持剑-近景" />
      <text>The girl slowly opened the old cloth, took out the family sword, and examined it carefully. </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <se id="01-21轩辕剑氛围声" />
      <cg img="氛围_通用_轩辕剑" />
      <text>Ancient Sword - Xuanyuan. </text>
      <text>The sword was two feet long, had a golden yellow body, was double edged, and adorned with dark gray patterns. </text>
      <text>The material was unknown, made with neither refined iron nor cold steel, but it was light as air, blew and broke hair, spoke of sharpness and hardness, and was fully worthy of the standards of a famous sword. </text>
      <cg />
      <transition mode="clock" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="久远时光中" />
      <bg img="忆剑山庄" />
      <text>When her mother passed the sword to her, she warned: </text>
      <dialog chara="009">
        <p>[This sword was passed down by your Taixuan Grandmaster, and it’s my most cherished family heirloom. </p>
        <p>You must put it away, keep it close to your body, and never let this sword leave your side.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="009">
        <p>[The true secret of [Edge of Taixuan] lies not in the techniques nor the tricks, but in this sword. </p>
        <p>After you understand Blade Sanction, you will understand what your mother means.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <text>Qin Suyi said, while squishing her cheeks, then gently spoke: </text>
      <dialog chara="009">[...But if you can’t comprehend it, it doesn’t matter. [\s]Blade Sanction is unpredictable, only your master never cultivated this Essence out of the seven of us; but in terms of martial art prowess, who of us could compare?]</dialog>
      <text>Her mother sighed suddenly: </text>
      <dialog chara="009">[Lingshuang has always been indifferent, and had contempt for profit… but after ten years, people can change.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="009">
        <p>[Sushang, you can’t hand the Xuanyuan Sword to her, even if she asks you to. [\s]</p>
        <p>If she asks why, you just say it was me.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <transition mode="clock" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="BGDesert03" />
      <mono inline="true">
        <p />
        <p>Sushang was noisy at first, but when she arrived at the desert, she cried symbolically, and soon was swayed by curiosity</p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="BGDesertWU" />
      <mono inline="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>The little kid couldn’t hide the words lodged in her throat, without two words, the Xuanyuan Sword topic already tumbled out of her mouth.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Her mother’s expectations were right, Master really asked her for the Xuanyuan Sword.[\s]</p>
        <p>Sushang was honest in nature, after thinking about it, she still handed over the ancient sword with both hands. </p>
      </mono>
      <text>
        <p>Master will never bully a five year old girl, and steal something right?[\s]</p>
        <p>She presented the Xuanyuan Sword to her Master, excitement filling up her heart, like a girl excitedly showing off her new clothes. </p>
      </text>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <bg img="回忆-弹剑" duration="3" pos="0,80" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <dialog chara="007">[...]</dialog>
      <text>Master laid the Xuanyuan Sword down flat on her knees, gently caressed the blade with her fingers, and after a while, she spoke:</text>
      <dialog chara="007">[This is Old Seventh’s [Ebonstyle]?]</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>Old Seventh… Sushang was startled, before remembering that she and her mother came from the same sect, ranking seventh. [\s]</p>
        <p>[Ebonstyle] is the name of the Xuanyuan Sword used by her mother. </p>
      </text>
      <text>After Master mentioned something, she remembered she never saw her mother take any action, nor use a weapon. </text>
      <dialog chara="002">[I don’t know, it should be~ My mother said it’s a family heirloom.]</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3.5" />
      <bg img="回忆-弹剑" duration="0.5" pos="0,900" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <bg img="回忆-程凌霜" duration="4" pos="0,80" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <dialog chara="007">[Oh… heirloom.]</dialog>
      <bg img="回忆-弹剑" pos="0,80" />
      <text>Master said coldly, looked at the sword on her lap again, and lightly flicked her slender finger on the blade. </text>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <text>Sushang was startled, the sword rose into the air.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="5" />
      <se id="01-21轩辕剑氛围声" looptimes="-1" />
      <bg img="轩辕剑-上升" pos="0,300" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <bg img="轩辕剑-上升" duration="30" pos="0,-900" />
      <delay t="4.5" />
      <text>It rose slowly, very slowly, and when it reached the peak, it paused for a moment.</text>
      <bg img="轩辕剑-光华" />
      <text>A beam of sunlight shone on the golden sword body, as if absorbed by the strange gray pattern, it suddenly bursted into the sky with colorful brilliance. </text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Ah…]</dialog>
      <text>Li Sushang looked completely captivated.</text>
      <text>Thinking about it carefully, the sword flying up and down only took around a second. </text>
      <text>
        <p>But to Sushang’s eyes, that was an infinitely long second. [\s]</p>
        <p>She had been with the sword since childhood, but she never thought that it was such a beautiful thing before. </p>
      </text>
      <cg img="氛围_通用_轩辕剑下落" />
      <text>
        <p>During the time that slowed down, the Xuanyuan shone brightly, slowly descending, [\s]</p>
        <p>and when it landed in front of her, the sword’s blade had sunk into the ground without making a sound. </p>
      </text>
      <se looptimes="0" />
      <cg />
      <bg img="回忆-程凌霜" pos="0,80" />
      <text>Her master stood up, and shook her robe:</text>
      <bg img="PureBlack" duration="1" />
      <dialog chara="007">[From tomorrow and on, you will work on cultivating your Blade Mantra; after the Blade Mantra has been studied, you practice your Blade Form; once you master your Blade Form, then you can wield this sword.]</dialog>
      <transition mode="clock" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="氛围_通用_轩辕剑" />
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <bg img="牢房-暗" />
      <text>
        <p>Sushang smiled at the memory. [\s]</p>
        <p>Now she was qualified to wield Xuanyuan. </p>
      </text>
      <text>Looking down at the sword in her hand, Sushang suddenly felt a ping of excitement. </text>
      <text>
        <p>Before her rationality intervened, instinctive reactions took control. [\s]</p>
        <p>The girl caressed the sword, imitating what her master did years ago, and flicked her finger on the blade. </p>
      </text>
      <cg />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <se id="01-32铁剑掷出" />
      <bg img="轩辕剑-弹飞" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>The sword flew up in the air, whistling, when it reached mid-air, the golden light was dazzling, and shone brightly. </text>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.5" range="40" direction="default" />
      <se id="01-41轩辕剑撞击声" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <se id="01-40轩辕剑掉落声" />
      <text>—The next moment, Xuanyuan hit the ceiling, before falling to the ground.</text>
      <bg img="牢房-亮" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-惊讶-普通-近景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[...Oh no.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="094" action="show" pos="right" img="砂匪1-远-普通" />
      <text>The door of the dungeon suddenly opened, light shot inside from the top, and a figure walked down the steps. </text>
      <motion chara="094" action="show" img="砂匪1-中-轻笑" pos="center" />
      <text>The man ignored the commotion all around, and walked straight towards her cell. </text>
      <text>Li Sushang recognized this Sand bandit:</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Sorry, my hand slipped… should it be okay? Did I bother him?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="094" action="img_trans" img="砂匪1-中-坏笑" />
      <text>The Sand bandit fixedly stared at her through the iron bars, and suddenly grinned, his laugh was hideousness:</text>
      <dialog chara="094">[The Boss wants to see you.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="094" action="hide" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Aiya… I knew it.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-嘟嘴-抱手-近景" />
      <text>Li Sushang sighed, knowing that she had been betrayed.</text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="2" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="11" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="11" prev="10" title="ピンタ">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <text>"Eagle" was joyous, startled, and furious.</text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="竹林伏兵" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站院内" duration="3" />
      <text inline="true">It was a joy to learn that his subordinates had caught the rat that made trouble. </text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>It was stunning to hear that the "invader" was actually a little girl.</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站" />
      <text>After seeing the girl, the "Eagle" finally burst into anger.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-嘟嘴-背手-远景" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <text inline="true">The soldiers he trained himself had been beaten like this by a teenage girl?! </text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>What an absolute humiliation!!!</p>
      </text>
      <text>In addition to his fury, he was a little surprised.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="002" action="move" pos="right" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="left" img="老鹰-普通-玩玉-远景" reversex="true" duration="1" />
      <delay t="0.8" />
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-标准-背手-远景" />
      <text>"Eagle" stepped forward, looking at the girl in front of him, with a lot of doubts in his mind:</text>
      <text>What is the origin of this girl?!</text>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Looking at the entire Northern Desert, there wasn't anyone not afraid of his Golden Sand Gang.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Even the most elite officers and soldiers thought his rule was far and hard, and never conflicted with it.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Who had the guts of a bear-hearted leopard and dared to break through the door, becoming an enemy of "Eagle"?</p>
      </mono>
      <text>He couldn't figure it out.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-标准-背手-远景" />
      <text>And—the one who came was still a little girl, she looked at most sixteen years old, her childishness was still there, and there was the youthful spirit of a young man in her eyes.</text>
      <text>And—— her martial arts wasn't bad, even surprisingly good. "Eagle"’s most prided men went into battle, but the four of them failed to capture her.</text>
      <text>What was the origin of this girl?!</text>
      <text inline="true">"Eagle" wanted to ask a question. But unexpectedly, it wasn't him who spoke first.</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>But unexpectedly, he wasn't the one who spoke first.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-大笑-背手-远景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[So you're "Eagle"? Wow, I didn't think–]</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <se id="01-42耳光轻-1" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="40" direction="default" />
      <motion chara="002" action="shake" duration="0.2" range="80" direction="horizontal" />
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" img="素裳-呆滞血-背手-远景" />
      <text inline="true">"Eagle" raised his hand and slapped Sushang severely, causing the words to be stuck in her throat.</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>In his turf, he was the only one who got to speak first, and he asked questions first.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="show" img="素裳-呆滞血-背手-远景" pos="right" duration="2" />
      <text>The girl raised her head, blood flowing from the corners of her mouth.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-撒娇哭-背手-远景" />
      <text>She looked at "Eagle" in disbelief, tears in her eyes.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[You… you hit me?? My mother didn't even–]</dialog>
      <se id="01-44耳光重" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="40" direction="default" />
      <motion chara="002" action="shake" duration="0.2" range="100" direction="horizontal" />
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <text>"Eagle" slapped Sushang again, this time the force was extremely heavy, and Sushang nearly tumbled to the ground.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-狞笑-扭头-远景" reversex="true" />
      <dialog chara="015">[...Next time you bring the captives back, shut their mouths first.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="094" action="show" pos="right" img="砂匪1-远-坏笑" />
      <dialog chara="094">「Yes, Chief.」</dialog>
      <motion chara="094" action="hide" duration="0.5" />
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" duration="0.5" />
      <text>
        <p>"Eagle" wiped his hands and squatted in front of the girl. </p>
        <p>The girl also looked up at him, there was no fear in her eyes, only stubbornness and annoyance.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-微笑-叉腰-中景" />
      <text>"Eagle" held her chin before saying:</text>
      <dialog chara="015">
        <p>[I don't know who you are or what your goal is; </p>
        <p>originally I was a little interested. </p>
        <p>So I thought I might as well listen to your intentions and if you could make me laugh, I might have been compassionate.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-普通-叉腰-中景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[...Now, you have lost this chance.]</dialog>
      <text>"Eagle" stared at the girl's eyes, the tears still remaining, enjoying the pleasure of punishing the enemy. </text>
      <text>This wasn't his style, but after meeting with the Raksha, his heart was full of boredom. Even knowing that threats and intimidation were meaningless, he continued.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-普通-抱胸NO刀-中景" />
      <dialog chara="015" inline="true">
        <p>[Next time, you have to know when you can speak and when you can't;  </p>
        <p>you have to learn to be cautious in your words and deeds in order to please your master and save your life.</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-微笑-抱胸NO刀-中景" />
      <dialog chara="015">
        <p />
        <p>In the future, people who will face each other day and night will never cherish your flesh and blood like I do.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="015">[You are young and good-looking. Skinny and (?) are believed to be likable. To be honest, I intend to sell you at a good price, so you have a few days to be safe. But don't be too happy too soon.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-狞笑-扭头-中景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[Wait a hundred times for the traffickers to take you away, you will regret not begging me to kill you today, I promise.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-悲伤-扭头-中景" />
      <dialog chara="015">
        <p>[“I regret it” and beg for mercy… You have to do these two things for a lifetime, until you die. </p>
        <p>Those who dare to provoke me to the Golden Sand Gang won't escape this fate.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <text>After all, "Eagle" glanced at the captive, and was disappointed. </text>
      <text>
        <p>The girl sniffed and nodded seriously at him without saying a word. </p>
        <p>Among the various reactions, it was the one that made him speechless.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <text>"Eagle" pushed Sushang away, wiped his hands on his clothes in disgust, and turned to the subordinates on the side:</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="right" img="老鹰-撩发笑-远景" duration="0.5" />
      <motion chara="095" action="show" reversex="true" pos="left" img="砂匪2-远-微笑" duration="0.5" />
      <dialog chara="015">[What are you thinking?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="095" action="img_trans" reversex="true" img="砂匪2-远-普通" />
      <text>The sudden question made the man sweat, and caused him to stutter.</text>
      <dialog chara="015">
        <p>[Since then, you have been restless… </p>
        <p>...What do you want to say? Speak.’</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="095">[Yes, it's boss... This girl, she, she's pretty good... Let's still take precautions…]</dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-撩发-远景" />
      <text>"Eagle" glanced at the man in disgust, who was frightened to take a step back.</text>
      <dialog chara="015">[You served her the [Ki Suppressant Pill].]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="095">[Yes...yes, she did not resist at all. We were worried...she had ulterior motives and would be against you.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-悲伤-扭头-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[A teenage girl, with both hands bound in shackles, she can't use all of her internal strength.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-微笑-抱胸NO刀-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[...And you thought she would be against me?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="095" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <dialog chara="095">[Your subordinate was wrong!]</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>The man lost his soul and knelt down quickly. </p>
        <p>He knew that the more gentle and calm the gang leader's tone, the more furious he became.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-普通-抱胸NO刀-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[……]</dialog>
      <text>"Eagle" was very angry in his heart, but  his face remained calm. This was a habit he has cultivated for many years. </text>
      <text>The Raksha upset him, the little girl annoyed him; the self-assertion of his subordinates made him vaguely feel that his authority had been challenged.</text>
      <dialog chara="015">[Take her... put her in the Dark Dungeon, and lock her up with the Raksha.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="015">[They are not allowed to have food, and they must be hungry until the slavers take them away.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="-1">[Yes!]</dialog>
      <text>The bandits responded in unison, pulled the girl up, and pushed her to the Dark Dungeon.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-普通-玩玉-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[……Um?]</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>The man who had just kneeled on the ground did not leave. </p>
        <p>He bowed his head, not daring to look up, but the trembling of his body had already revealed his tension.</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="015">[What else do you want to say?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="095" action="show" pos="left" img="砂匪2-远-微笑" reversex="true" />
      <text>The man straightened up as if he had received a pardon, showing a little excited smile.</text>
      <dialog chara="095">[This subordinate has a treasure dedicated to the leader. I hope I can make up for it.]</dialog>
      <text>As he spoke, he magically took out a cloth bag and presented it with both hands.</text>
      <text>"Eagle" didn't stretch out his hand, didn't even look at the cloth bag, and asked:</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-普通-抱胸NO刀-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[What's inside? Where did it come from?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="095">"A sword that cuts iron like mud, taken from that little girl."</dialog>
      <dialog chara="015">[……]</dialog>
      <motion chara="095" action="img_trans" img="砂匪2-远-普通" reversex="true" />
      <text inline="true">[……]</text>
      <text>"Eagle" still didn't pick it up. The man also maintained his posture, and didn't dare to move an inch.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-微笑-玩玉-远景" />
      <text>
        <p>After a long time, "Eagle" smiled suddenly, reached out his hand to take the cloth bag, and slowly untied the cloth wrapped around it, revealing the true face of the sword in it. [\s]</p>
        <p>He had confirmed that the man in front of him had not concealed or lied, that was enough.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <motion chara="095" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <cg img="氛围_通用_轩辕剑" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <dialog chara="015">[Oh–]</dialog>
      <text>Under the faint moonlight, the sword shone with a silvery light.</text>
      <text>At a glance, he knew that this sword was a wonder of the world.</text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="12" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="12" prev="11" title="悪い羅刹人">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="牢房-暗" />
      <se id="01-34男沙地重摔" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.5" range="40" direction="default" />
      <text>Thump. </text>
      <text>Li Sushang fell and rolled across the ground.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Ngh—]</dialog>
      <text>Although she wasn’t hurt, Li Sushang still cried out by instinct. The soft voice of a young girl changed its tune as it passed through the dirty rag in her mouth, becoming a quiet wail.</text>
      <text>A couple of bandits laughed outside, their words vile and full of obscenities.</text>
      <bg img="PureBlack" duration="4" />
      <text>
        <p>Click. [\s]</p>
        <p>The door was locked.</p>
      </text>
      <text>The flickering light of the torch disappeared with the footsteps, leaving the little girl in the Dark Dungeon.</text>
      <text>
        <p>Sushang wriggled her body, attempting to sit upright; [\s]</p>
        <p>her eyes hadn’t yet adjusted to the darkness, so she couldn’t see anything, but her legs seemed to have brushed against something while she was squirming around.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <se id="01-50奥托叹气" />
      <text>Someone sighed.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <bg img="牢房-暗" duration="3" />
      <delay t="2.5" />
      <text>With their voice, a small flame abruptly rose from inside the shabby room, barely enough to give light to the dark cell.</text>
      <bgm id="神秘东方" />
      <bg img="牢房-亮" duration="4" />
      <delay t="4" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="center" img="素裳-惊讶-背手-中景" duration="1" />
      <text>
        <p>Li Sushang was startled, [\s]</p>
        <p>not by the sudden light, but by the person who was speaking.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="0.2" color="#000000" />
      <se id="01-37棺材氛围声loop" looptimes="-1" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="8" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托地牢_看杯" duration="0" scale="3" origin="25%,75%" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0.2" stop="0.1" out="0.2" color="#000000" />
      <cg duration="0" scale="3" img="CG_第一折_奥托地牢_看杯" origin="25%,25%" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0.2" stop="0.1" out="0.2" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托地牢_看杯" duration="0" scale="3" origin="75%,75%" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0.2" stop="0.1" out="0.2" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托地牢_看杯" duration="0" scale="3" origin="75%,25%" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="0.2" stop="0.1" out="0.2" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托地牢_看杯" />
      <text>It was a woman, about 20 years old. Her skin was snowy white, elegant features adorning her figure. She didn’t look like someone from Shenzhou at all, but rather the legendary celestials.</text>
      <text>The small flame hovered next to her ear, giving off an even more ominous vibe.</text>
      <text>
        <p>[em italic]A Raksha…[/em][\s]</p>
        <p>Li Sushang remembered the whispers of the bandits.[\s]</p>
        <p>[em italic]So this is what a Raksha looks like.[/em]</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托地牢_看杯" duration="8" scale="2.8" origin="5%,3%" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <text>
        <p>She looked to the woman’s side and saw a large coffin. </p>
        <p>That was the large hunk of wood that Sushang had almost kicked.</p>
      </text>
      <text>Coffins were not an uncommon sight, nor were they a taboo subject. Regardless, even someone who’s heard many frightening stories like Sushang couldn’t help but feel chills crawling down her spine. It was a terrifying object to come upon in this moment, while she was trapped in a dark dungeon.</text>
      <text>
        <p>She moved her gaze by instinct, focusing on the Raksha woman again.</p>
        <p>At first, she only stole a few glances, but after seeing no reaction from her, she began to look her up and down.</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托地牢_看杯" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>The Raksha ignored her rude gaze and simply shook the glass container in his hand.</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托地牢_看人" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Mmmmmph?]</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>She forgot that she was still gagged, so her words became a pile of gibberish. [\s]</p>
        <p>Li Sushang’s looked embarrassed, but luckily, the dim atmosphere was doing her many favors right now.</p>
      </text>
      <text>She gestured at the woman, trying to get her to remove the rag in her mouth.</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托地牢_看杯" />
      <text>
        <p>Li Sushang blinked several times, but she ignored all of her attempts, choosing instead to continue lounging around.</p>
        <p>She tried exchanging a few glances with her, but she ignored all of them. She didn't react in the slightest</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">（This guy —)</dialog>
      <text>A thought suddenly entered her mind, and she raised her feet, preparing to kick the coffin.</text>
      <se id="01-47火熄灭" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="0.2" stop="0.5" out="0.1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <cg />
      <text>However, the flame suddenly went out for a moment as she raised her feet. Then, her mouth was freed.</text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="1" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <se id="01-48火燃烧" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_奥托地牢_看人" duration="3" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>
        <p>As the fire appeared once more, Li Sushang looked at the Raksha sitting next to the wall. [\s]</p>
        <p>She was still in her original position, but this time, her eyes had a sliver of annoyance.</p>
      </text>
      <cg duration="1" img="CG_第一折_奥托地牢_看杯" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <dialog chara="001" inline="true">[What do you want?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p />
        <p>[You’re a man?]</p>
      </dialog>
      <text>The two spoke at the same time, and then paused at the same time.</text>
      <text>
        <p>The Raksha stopped talking, silently affirming her statement. </p>
        <p>On the other hand, Li Sushang couldn’t stop talking:</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[Me? I wasn’t trying to do anything. I just wanted you to take the rag out of my mouth. </p>
        <p>Thanks. You’re a good person. You’re just… A little girly.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[I owe you one now, so I’ll definitely repay you in the future. </p>
        <p>As soon as I focus and get these cuffs off, I’ll help you — Where are your cuffs?!]</p>
      </dialog>
      <text>
        <p>Unlike Li Sushang, who was cuffed and gagged, </p>
        <p>the Raksha had nothing of the sort on him.</p>
      </text>
      <text>Even worse, he was sitting on a fancy chair and sipping a red liquid out from a small glass cup. He looked as elegant as one could be in this moment.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Aren’t… Aren’t you a prisoner?]</dialog>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="牢房-亮" />
      <cg />
      <motion chara="001" action="show" pos="left" duration="2" img="奥托-严肃-标准-中景（棺材）" />
      <se id="01-05痊愈" />
      <se id="01-37棺材氛围声loop" looptimes="0" />
      <text>Without a word, the Raksha stood up, the chair and the glass disappearing like melting snow in the fire light.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="right" img="素裳-吓脸黑-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002" inline="true">[Huhhhhhhhhh… </dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-吓-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">Sorcery! This is sorcery! You’re a demon!]</dialog>
      <text>Li Sushang looked pale.</text>
      <text>
        <p>She wasn’t afraid of a lot of things, but she respected the mystical and divine. [\s]</p>
        <p>The little trick that the Raksha just pulled scared her to death, so much so that she dropped all pretenses as a vigilante heroine.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="001" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <text>Her scream was long and shrill, echoing in the cell, but nobody said a thing, nor did they bother to come and see what was going on. [\s]The Raksha waited for her to stop and look at his shadow casted by the flame and then spoke:</text>
      <motion chara="001" action="show" pos="left" duration="1" img="奥托-标准-标准-中景（棺材）" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="right" duration="1" img="素裳-吓脸黑-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="001">[No.]</dialog>
      <text>Li Sushang thought about it before realizing that he was answering his question. </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-欸真的吗-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002" inline="true">[No what? You’re not a demon? Oh wait, you said you’re not a prisoner. Hmm? Then why did they lock you up down here? </dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-嘟嘴-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p />
        <p>No wait, you’re lying to me —]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[...]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目前-背手-中景" />
      <text>The Raksha didn’t say a thing. It was hard to tell if he’d even understood what she said. </text>
      <text>Li Sushang stole a glance at the man, taking her time to marvel at his handsomeness. She didn’t think he looked like a bad person, and as her thoughts got carried away, she began coming up with legendary backstories for this Raksha.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-惊讶2-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[Were you also captured by the Golden Sand Gang? </p>
        <p>No, those people are rotten to the core, how would they forget to cuff a prisoner?]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[Are you one of “Eagle’s” guests? Is that why they’re so nice to you…. </p>
        <p>No, otherwise I wouldn’t be tossed in here with you.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[...]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-小恶魔-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[...]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[Wait a minute… Are you like me then? Right? I guessed correctly, right?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-笑-背手-中景" />
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-微笑自信-标准-中景（棺材）" />
      <text>The Raksha shrugged, the corners of his mouth bearing a slight smile:</text>
      <dialog chara="001">[How would I know what you’re thinking? I’m not you.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-大笑-背手-中景" />
      <bgm id="原始武士" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Hmm… I’ll tell you then]</dialog>
      <event action="goto" to="13" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="13" type="block" prev="12" title="悪い羅刹人2">
      <text>The girl began rambling again:</text>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-标准-标准-中景（棺材）" />
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-元气-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[You know those people up there are called the Golden Sand Gang right? </p>
        <p>They’re a bunch of bad people who do everything evil that you can imagine.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-浅笑-背手-中景" />
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-微笑自信-标准-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="002">[By the orders of my master, I have come to eradicate these nuisances. Those who are heroes shall fight for the righteous and weed out evil to grant justice to the people and peace to this land… Uh, that’s what all those storytellers say, anyway.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目前-背手-中景" />
      <text>She cleared her throat, looking shyly at the Raksha. She saw the latter staring at her intently, and she suddenly felt tiny sparks of joy inside her. She straightened her back, and her tone became more serious.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" duration="1" img="素裳-愤怒-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[The Golden Sand Gang was inconsequential, </p>
        <p>but now, a man called “Eagle” has become their ringleader.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[He is not someone to be taken lightly, as my master has informed me that he is a practitioner of the martial arts, a skilled one at that. Otherwise, my master would not have sent me here.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-笑-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[I’ve come here first to take care of an evil that’s been pestering the good folk of the Northern Desert; </p>
        <p>Second, I’m here to test my mettle.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-欸真的吗-背手-中景" />
      <text>Sushang felt a bit guilty being so boastful, </text>
      <text>but seeing as the Raksha was listening to her carefully with no other comments, the girl’s mood improved drastically. She believed the golden-haired stranger was an exceptional person to chat with.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-标准-背手-中景" />
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-思索-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Our martial arts at the Wanderer’s House is called the [Edge of Taixuan], the one-of-a-kind martial arts belonging to the legendary Phoenix. It is the most complex martial arts across the lands.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-小恶魔-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[The Edge of Taixuan has five essences: Mantra, Form, Sanction, Ascension, and Eminence. </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002" inline="true">To be honest with you, I’ve made progress in the Mantra, Form, and Ascension ~</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目下-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p />
        <p>... But I’ve been stuck at the Xuanyuan Sanction phase for a while now.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-嘟嘴-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Not even my master knows how to train the Sanction Essence, but my mom can; she said 【When you heart has connected with the Xuanyuan, the Sanction essence will come as naturally as night to day.】But it’s just a sword, what kind of thoughts does it even have? </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">I’ve talked to it for more than a decade, but it’s never done a thing, not even a yep. Aye, I really want to get it straight, but I haven’t been home for a while now…]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-浅笑-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Ah, I haven’t told you yet, the Xuanyuan Sword is… Uh, never mind… </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">Those bandits stole my sword, but don’t worry, I’ll get it back in no time. As for how —]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" duration="1" img="素裳-大笑潇洒-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[I have my ways!]</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>The girl said with excitement, her eyes shining. [\s]</p>
        <p>Although she seemed way too eccentric and all over the place, the Raksha enjoyed listening to her.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-元气-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[I’ve learnt the ways of the blade for ten years with my master now. </p>
        <p>It’s kind of embarrassing to say this, but I haven’t fought any other experts besides my master. </p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">Mom always said that practice is different from real life, but I don’t think it’s as mysterious as she likes to put it.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-笑-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Don’t underestimate me just because I’m young, I’m actually pretty powerful. I’ll tell you this, I defeated four men just now with no blood shed at all. </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">It’s not that simple, you have to be really careful with how you control your strength~]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[How did you defeat the Golden Menace Gang if you didn’t kill anyone?]</dialog>
      <text>The Raksha’s question seemed to come at just the right moment, even if his Shenzhounese wasn’t the most accurate, but Sushang didn’t mind.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目下-背手-中景" duration="1" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[Um, well, you do have to kill if you have to. </p>
        <p>If you can save 100 by killing one, then that’s a good thing… I think.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目前-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[But I haven’t killed anyone before, so there’s always this… Thought in the back of my mind. That’s a whole life! If I could, I’d rather not kill anyone…]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[So my hope is to defeat that “Eagle” guy. </p>
        <p>With him gone, the gang will be no more. There’s no point in dealing with the rabble.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[Mhm.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-大笑-背手-中景" />
      <text>He answered, but Sushang mistook it for his desire for her to continue the conversation, so she became excited.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-撒娇哭-背手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Let me tell you — Ow!]</dialog>
      <motion chara="001" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <text>She forgot that she was still cuffed, so her attempt to separate her arms only hurt her.</text>
      <text>The [Ki Suppressant Pill] that the Golden Sand Gang had given her was quite the poison indeed. She could feel the Ki in her lower Dantian Sea, but it refused to flow into her veins. She had all the Ki she needed, but no way to use it.</text>
      <text inline="true">— However, the girl had learned the [Edge of Taixuan]. </text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>Phoenix’s martial arts were different from the thousands of others in these lands.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Normally, the arts would train the Dantian to store the Qi, </p>
        <p>but the [Edge of Taixuan] wasn’t so strict about that.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>The one who had learned the [Blade Mantra] </p>
        <p>could see the world as their Dantian Sea and their body as the veins. </p>
        <p>The [Ki] that was the origin point of martial arts had no need to be buried within oneself.</p>
      </text>
      <text>That’s why to Li Sushang, her lower Dantian Sea being blocked was a bit uncomfortable, but it was nothing too serious.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="show" duration="1" img="素裳-嘟嘴-背手-中景" pos="right" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Oh wait, it’s a hassle talking like this, so let me get these cuffs off first —]</dialog>
      <motion chara="001" action="show" duration="1" img="奥托-微笑自信-单十字-中景（棺材）" pos="left" />
      <dialog chara="001">[Allow me.]</dialog>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1.5" />
      <se id="01-46铁镣铐撒地" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>
        <p>Sushang felt her limbs lighten as soon as his voice faded. The two pairs of thick steel cuffs had already shattered into pieces on the ground. [\s]</p>
        <p>She was not injured in the slightest either.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" duration="2" img="素裳-呆滞刺激-普通-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[You… You…]</dialog>
      <text>Li Sushang couldn’t figure out what to say. She’d already seen so many strange things from the moment she laid eyes on this Raksha beauty. </text>
      <text>
        <p>If he could use his sorcery to disappear the chair and the glass cup, then it would be reasonable that he could shatter those steel cuffs… [\s]</p>
        <p>...my ass!!!!</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>She began to reconsider the strange coffin carrying man standing in front of her. [\s]</p>
        <p>Was [he] actually a master in disguise? </p>
      </text>
      <text>She didn’t believe it.</text>
      <text>
        <p>The experts and masters in her eyes were ones like her master, her mother, or herself in the future, </p>
        <p>and the Raksha seemed way too far from what she thought of as an expert.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-惊讶2-抱手-中景" />
      <text>[em italic]But he can do some pretty unnatural stuff….[/em]</text>
      <text>She was lost in her thoughts when the Raksha suddenly spoke:</text>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-微笑奸-单空手-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="001">[What is this plan of yours?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-惊讶-普通-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Mmm, mmm… Hmm?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[Your plan.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目下-抱手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Oh, I…]</dialog>
      <text>For some reason, she had a little less confidence in herself after the Raksha did his thing just now.</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目下-抱手-中景" />
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-微笑自信-标准-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="002">[I… I was going to sneak into the bandit’s camp and find a chance to challenge “Eagle”.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[But… Sigh, I lied, things weren’t going so well. I was trying to break out of my cuffs, go find my sword, and then… cross the bridge when I get to it. </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">There’s no elaborate scheme. I just don’t want to… I… I can’t say.]</dialog>
      <text>The girl’s voice got quieter and quieter.</text>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-思索-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="001">[Can you win?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-惊讶2-普通-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Ha?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-标准-单空手-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="001">[You said you were going to challenge that eagle.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-严肃-抱手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[... Hmm, I think so.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-微笑自信-单空手-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="001">[Good, let’s go.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-呆滞刺激-抱手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[R-Right now?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-苦笑-摊手-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="001">[Wasn’t that your plan?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[I mean, yeah, but…]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目下-抱手-中景" />
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-微笑自信-标准-中景（棺材）" />
      <text>She lowered her head and spoke hurriedly and sadly:</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[It’s midnight right now… What kind of hero challenges someone to a duel in the dark? That’s not righteous at all…]</dialog>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-思索-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="001">[Righteous…]</dialog>
      <text>The Raksha considered that term.</text>
      <dialog chara="001">[Are you talking about the day? You want to challenge that eagle when everyone’s present?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-元气-普通-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Yes!]</dialog>
      <text>She answered with gusto.</text>
      <dialog chara="001">[There’s one thing though.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[Please.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[During the day, that Eagle is going to have hundreds of his minions protecting him, will he actually accept your challenge?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-欸真的吗-抱手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Of course he will! That’s the laws of the land! He…]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目下-抱手-中景" />
      <text>Li Sushang thought about it and sighed.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[You have a point.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-微笑奸-摊手-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="001">
        <p>[So it’s impossible, in the day. </p>
        <p>If you want to win, the night is your best chance.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-微笑自信-标准-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Mhm…]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">
        <p>[I heard that Shenzhou has an ancient proverb:</p>
        <p>【 I desire fish, yet I also desire a bear’s paw】. </p>
        <p>That is to say that the two are conflicting things, and it's hard to pick between them.</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-微笑自信-摊手-中景（棺材）" />
      <dialog chara="001">
        <p>[【Righteousness】is the fish. </p>
        <p>【Exacting Justice】is the bear’s paw.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">
        <p>[If you want to be righteous, then you won’t be able to exact justice. </p>
        <p>【The two are mutually exclusive. Those who give up the fish will get the bear’s paw.】</p>
        <p>You can’t have everything in this world. You will always lose something, so you have to choose.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[....]</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="0.5" />
      <se id="01-06痊愈" />
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-微笑自信-单十字-中景（棺材）" duration="0.5" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <text>The Raksha’s hands danced across the air with elegance.</text>
      <dialog chara="001">[Well let’s go then, milady?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002" inline="true">[Oh… </dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-嘟嘴-抱手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">Fine.]</dialog>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="001" action="hide" />
      <se id="01-47火熄灭" />
      <bg img="牢房-暗" duration="2" />
      <text>
        <p>The Raksha smiled lightly, and the fire suddenly disappeared from the air.[\s]</p>
        <p>… No, the fire was still there. </p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>That ball of fire seemed to have teleported beside the Raksha’s hand, burning brighter and brighter… [\s]</p>
        <p>It was like…</p>
      </text>
      <text>A sword?</text>
      <se id="01-48火燃烧" />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="1" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <bg img="牢房-亮" />
      <text>
        <p>Sushang watched, dumbfounded by the Raksha’s [sorcery]. [\s]</p>
        <p>By the time she snapped out of it, the fire was gone and the doors were open, leaving only a charred scent lingering around her nose.</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <motion chara="001" action="show" pos="center" duration="1.5" img="奥托-微笑奸-单空手-近景（棺材）" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <dialog chara="001">[Please.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[....]</dialog>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-标准-标准-近景（棺材）" />
      <text>Li Sushang moved forward obediently but suddenly stopped after taking a few steps, turning her head and said with a pout:</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[You just told me to do bad things. You… You’re a bad Raksha.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[Oh,]</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <se id="01-51奥托叹气2" />
      <motion chara="001" action="show" pos="center" img="奥托-悲伤-标准-近景（棺材）" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" duration="5" />
      <motion chara="001" action="hide" duration="5" />
      <text>He sighed, not a hint of guilt in his voice.</text>
      <dialog chara="001">[Perhaps.]</dialog>
      <text>Sushang couldn’t make out his expression in the darkness, but she sensed that his voice had an intangible sadness to it.</text>
      <dialog chara="001">[There is no right or wrong to what I do.]</dialog>
      <transition mode="fade" in="3" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Earlier, there were two guards outside of the cell.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>One of them escorted the Raksha in the dungeon respectfully, then immediately called in sick; the other was delivering a meal when he was scared out of his mind and refused to reenter the dungeon.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>[Is that person even human? That’s a demon! Have you ever seen a talking lantern? I won’t go. You can’t make me.]</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>It’s almost as if the outlander in the cell was even scarier than “Eagle”.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>The even stranger thing was that “Eagle” was not angry at all, like he usually would be.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>[We’ll have plenty of people in a couple of days, so just send some more help.]</p>
        <p />
        <p>He sent about 10 people or so, all armed.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The newcomers carefully entered the cell but came out fine, so their fear disappeared pretty quickly and instead began to mock the two guards before them.</p>
        <p />
        <p>But either way, the bandits didn’t underestimate the man and split into day and night guards to ensure that there would always be at least five people guarding the cell.</p>
        <p />
        <p>Of course, those five unlucky few hadn’t the slightest clue of what happened inside the dungeon.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="BGSky04" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>It’s strange. There was no sound at all coming out of the cell that we threw the girl who angered our leader in.</p>
        <p />
        <p>An all-encompassing silence— A deathly calmness.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>No voices, no random noises, nothing.</p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The guards didn’t hear anything strange, but they smelled something weird: something was burning.</p>
        <p />
        <p>That scent grew stronger and stronger as the five of them picked up their blades and gathered at the entrance.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>[You wanna go down there?]</p>
        <p>A guard asked the others quietly.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The door exploded before the others could answer.</p>
      </mono>
      <se id="01-52爆破" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="爆炸" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>The last thing that the five of them saw was the crimson tendril of fire.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="14" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="14" prev="13" title="月下の剣舞">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="原始武士" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站院内" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-普通-叉腰-远景" duration="2" />
      <text>It was deep into the night, yet “Eagle” wasn’t tired.</text>
      <text>The parlor of the dilapidated Stop was brightly lit, making the light and shadows divide the yard outside of the hall split to two. </text>
      <text>“Eagle” stood in the yard. His eight most trusted subordinates stood nearby, watching him sword dancing.  </text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="move" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站" />
      <text>“Eagle” was no swordsman, nor was he proficient in swordsmanship. He was once a member of the military, and learned greatsword techniques. </text>
      <text>
        <p>Sword and greatsword techniques appear the same, but they're in fact completely different.</p>
        <p>As people say [Swords are quick, greatswords are strong.] Swords travel with trickery, flexible yet varying; greatswords are fair, breaking through with power. </p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>When a sword wielder is given a greatsword, they will use it like a sword, the same is vice versa. </p>
        <p>Therefore, although “Eagle” was sword dancing, he was actually greatsword dancing.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" img="老鹰-狞笑-拔刀预备-近景" duration="2" pos="center" />
      <text inline="true">The reason why he has the sword, is also because the sword is really satisfying.</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>He had never seen such a perfect blade!</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.2" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="thick" />
      <bg img="轩辕剑-横行" pos="-1020,0" />
      <se id="01-18男性沙漠疾行_01" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <bg img="轩辕剑-横行" duration="40" pos="0,0" />
      <text>“Eagle” hauled the sword in his hand, his movement swift. Suddenly his wrist quivered, and three sword flowers bloomed.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <se id="01-49舞剑" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text inline="true">It seemed to be like an ink filled brush. Wherever the sword went, dark gray lines were left behind in the air, like freehand calligraphy. </text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>This was exactly like the beauty of the sword’s patterns, very gratifying.</p>
      </text>
      <se id="01-27大刀横挥" />
      <text inline="true">“Eagle” stabbed sharply with the sword, and pulled out the strength from his wrist. The sword’s body didn’t move, yet the sword edge seemed to quiver slightly, singing with the sound of a soft hum. </text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>This fit the firmness of the sword’s body, sturdiness and softness.</p>
      </text>
      <se id="01-21轩辕剑氛围声" />
      <cg />
      <text inline="true">When the sword was retracted, it slowed for a moment again. When the blade reached the chest, the edge was cool, and the light shined.</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>This was exactly what the sword’s shine was like, the cold light penetrated through bones. </p>
      </text>
      <se id="01-21轩辕剑氛围声" looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站院内" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" img="老鹰-狞笑-拔刀预备-近景" pos="center" duration="2" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>“Eagle” couldn’t help but laugh heartily, and he pulled out a string of hair and held it above the blade. When he let it go, the hair split to two. </text>
      <text>This is just how acute the sword is: so sharp that it would cut falling hair.</text>
      <text>If it has the four aforementioned traits, this sword could be considered as legendary. </text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-专注-拔刀预备-近景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[Priceless, priceless…]</dialog>
      <text>“Eagle” murmured. </text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="move" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站" />
      <text>
        <p>“Eagle” isn’t a sword lover or collector. </p>
        <p>Even if he speaks words of praise, it’s nothing more than just a bandit admiring his spoils. </p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <cg img="氛围_通用_轩辕剑" scale="1.5" origin="80%,0%" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <cg img="氛围_通用_轩辕剑" duration="10" scale="1.5" pos="400,-200" origin="80%,0%" />
      <text>A person who knows goods well would be able to tell that this sword on the girl’s body is worth more than silver or gold.</text>
      <text inline="true">But he was still a warrior. </text>
      <text>Famous swords were like beautiful jades since ancient times, and whoever wins it would be admired.</text>
      <text>“Eagle” decided to keep it. Not because it had anything to do with gold or silver, but rather as a symbol of status.</text>
      <text>After all, a figure like him, should have a weapon that matches.</text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰笑" scale="2.5" origin="15%,0%" />
      <text>As the Golden Sand Gang examined Li Sushang’s『Xuanyuan』from left to right, the more gratified he became.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Do you like my sword that much?]</dialog>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰惊李抱胸" scale="2.5" origin="15%,0%" />
      <dialog chara="015">[! ! ! ! !]</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg duration="2" img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰惊李抱胸" origin="15%,0%" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <text>“Eagle” was shocked, and instinctively backed away six feet.</text>
      <text>
        <p>He couldn’t believe the scene in front of his eyes.[\s]</p>
        <p>Eight men were lying on the ground, all unconscious. </p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>And the girl that he ordered to be taken to the Dark Dungeon, was blinking at him.[\s]</p>
        <p>[em italic]WHAT HAPPENED!?!?[/em]</p>
      </text>
      <text>…If this is a joke, he would cut the mastermind into pieces, and feed them to a horse.</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰惊李伸手" duration="2" />
      <text>But the girl appeared fearless, stretching her hands:</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Hey, you’ve played enough with it, so it’s time to give it back to me now.] </dialog>
      <dialog chara="015">「...Don't be ridiculous!」</dialog>
      <text>“Eagle” was already distraught, but the girl’s dialogue made him even more irritated.</text>
      <text>He doesn’t like the feeling of being confused about the circumstances, and he wanted to regain control of the situation.</text>
      <dialog chara="015">[...How did you escape?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[Oh, it was a Raksha who helped me out… Eh, where did he go?]</dialog>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰惊李普通_呆滞" duration="2" />
      <text>The girl turned her head, her back, and looked around.</text>
      <dialog chara="015">[※※, damn that Raksha!]</dialog>
      <cg duration="2" img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰惊李普通_呆滞" />
      <text>
        <p>“Eagle” cursed at himself viciously in his mind.[\s]</p>
        <p>If you were aware of a『hazard』, then it would be better to get rid of it as soon as possible.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>It’s precisely because he was afraid of these hazards, that hazards often cause problems.[\s]</p>
        <p>“Eagle” regretted not paying attention to the strange Raksha, but at this moment, regret was no longer helpful.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>He stepped back quietly, forming a safe distance for dialogue. This was actually unnecessary, because he was the one holding the sword.[\s]</p>
        <p>…But, it wasn’t the girl Eagle was worried about.</p>
      </text>
      <text>At this moment, the moon shines brightly. The shadows reflected by the throbbing candlelight danced wildly on the bluestone floor, and it was a good time to solve the problem. </text>
      <dialog chara="015">[What about that Raksha? …Where is he?]</dialog>
      <cg duration="2" img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰惊李伸手" />
      <dialog chara="002">[I don’t know.]</dialog>
      <text>The girl was telling the truth, she seemed to not know what lies were. </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-专注-抱手-中景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[He was behind me, but he suddenly disappeared.]</dialog>
      <text>This truly is the worst answer.[\s]In fact, “Eagle” didn’t pay attention to the girl at all. [\s]No matter how good an opponent’s martial arts is, it was impossible for him to lose to such a straightforward kid. </text>
      <text>
        <p>From the beginning to the end, he regarded that Raksha as his biggest threat. </p>
        <p>And being unable to grasp that person’s movements made him anxious. </p>
      </text>
      <text>The Raksha may have disappeared faraway, or may be hiding somewhere just waiting for an opportunity— but no matter what it was, a thorn was always in his heart. He wouldn’t feel at ease until he took him out.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Hey, don’t look for him, your opponent right now is me.]</dialog>
      <cg duration="2" img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰惊李抱拳_哼" />
      <text>The girl retracted her outstretched hand, her palm was over her fist.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[I’m gonna take my sword back now~ Eldest Disciple of Wanderer’s House Li Sushang, please enlighten me!]</dialog>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <text>Her words she spoke were inappropriate for the present moment, making a strange pose anyways.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <se id="01-30女孩轻功whoosh_02" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_起手姿势_1" duration="2" scale="1.2" />
      <text>Before “Eagle” could react, the girl suddenly appeared in front of him. </text>
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="1000" direction="vertical" />
      <cg duration="0" />
      <se id="01-28胸口命中" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="50" direction="default" />
      <delay t="0.7" />
      <se id="01-40轩辕剑掉落声" />
      <bgm id="传奇诞生" />
      <text>Quicker than words could tell, he felt pain in his forearm, and the sword dropped from his hand. </text>
      <dialog chara="015">[You—]</dialog>
      <se id="01-23腿部命中" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="50" direction="default" />
      <text>He took another palm to the chest.</text>
      <text>“Eagle” staggered back a few steps, hurriedly adjusting his breath, but his inner organs were scrambling endlessly, and it was difficult to calm down.</text>
      <bg img="废弃驿站院内" duration="0.5" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-惊讶-肉搏备战-中景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[...You!]</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>This palm wasn’t powered by internal force, though it was heavy, since it didn’t hurt the internal organs after all. </p>
        <p>But the girl’s light handed agility was something “Eagle” rarely saw.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>“Eagle” was shocked, left the Raksha behind in his mind, </p>
        <p>and decided to re-evaluate this opponent who was between ten to twenty years old.</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="15" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="15" prev="14" title="約束">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_起手姿势_1" duration="1" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_起手姿势_1" duration="10" pos="-50,75" scale="1.2" />
      <bgm id="传奇诞生" />
      <text inline="true">Li Sushang leaned down, bent her left knee just merely inches from the ground, and lightly touched the ground using four to five fingers. </text>
      <text>If someone noticed her appearance at that moment, they would’ve found it hilarious right?</text>
      <text>But, with the speed of Li Sushang body, the vision of a normal human simply can’t capture the strange starting formation. </text>
      <text>
        <p>This move wasn’t from Edge of Taixuan, but rather a secret technique passed down by the Li Family: </p>
        <p>[Fleeting Swallow].</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="1000" direction="vertical" />
      <se id="01-30女孩轻功whoosh_02" />
      <cg duration="0.1" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <bg img="BGPureWhite00" />
      <bg img="老鹰黑屏" duration="0" pos="-600,0" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <bg img="老鹰黑屏" duration="0.5" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <text>In an azure flash, Li Sushang dashed and hit “Eagle.” </text>
      <text>She was the first to strike, the attack being a palm blade. </text>
      <bg img="老鹰黑屏" duration="0.3" scale="3" origin="45%,80%" />
      <delay t="0.3" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="竖劈-上下(透明) " />
      <se id="01-22女孩轻功whoosh_01" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" delay="0.2" />
      <se id="01-23腿部命中" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.2" range="400" direction="vertical" />
      <bg img="老鹰黑屏" duration="0.1" />
      <delay t="0.3" />
      <se id="01-28胸口命中" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.2" range="400" direction="horizontal" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="left" img="对战特效（小）" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" delay="0.2" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <text>
        <p>She hit “Eagle”'s wrist with her right palm, shooting down [Xuanyuan], </p>
        <p>Then she slapped the man’s heart with a lightning quick backhand, shaking them away.</p>
      </text>
      <se id="01-57接住剑柄" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="4" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="left" img="老鹰-惊讶-肉搏备战-远景" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" img="素裳-笑-背剑-远景" pos="right" duration="2" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>At the same time, her left hand accurately caught the falling sword.</text>
      <text>
        <p>A familiar sense of peace flowed through her heart.</p>
        <p>As she touched her sword, she felt really great. </p>
      </text>
      <text>Li Sushang shook the sword, then gave “Eagle” a smile:</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-大笑-背剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Thanks.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-微笑-肉搏备战-远景" />
      <text inline="true">Her tone was sincere and cute, but it was a huge humiliation to “Eagle.”</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>For many years in the Northern Desert, he never suffered a defeat like this.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="move" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" direction="right" custom="default" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>“Eagle” felt a sudden urge to kill, along with the surging desire of vengeance. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Not only did he want to kill Li Sushang, he wanted to give her a miserable death.</p>
      </mono>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_老鹰战姿_掌" duration="3" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Maintaining the posture for facing an enemy,</p>
        <p />
        <p>The leader of the Golden Sand Gang cautioned himself,</p>
        <p>He genuinely branded the girl in front of him as a [strong enemy]. </p>
      </mono>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_老鹰战姿_掌" duration="30" scale="1.8" origin="10%,10%" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>This was war.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Not a match, not a duel, but a war.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Though the scale was small, the goal was simple, but it was war.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Therefore,</p>
        <p />
        <p>This place was a battlefield where “Eagle” was the best in,</p>
        <p>Now it was war time that “Eagle” was most used to.</p>
        <p />
        <p>Within a few seconds, his mind ran wild, and he already calculated the disadvantages, advantages, and variables.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="dissolve" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站" />
      <cg />
      <mono>There’s one disadvantage, it was the [Strength Difference].</mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>“Eagle” understood it very clearly, also wasn’t ashamed to admit it:</p>
        <p>The little girl in front of his eyes, was far above him in terms of both external and internal strength. </p>
        <p>Even stronger than any person from the Jianghu Society he knew. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The sheer power gap is like heaven and earth, the end of a match would be laid out from the start</p>
        <p>—If only, it was just a match.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>There were two variables, some [Unknowns].</mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Those two palm blades didn’t use internal force, is the [Binding Dust] still in effect?</p>
        <p>Two people escaped from the dungeon, is the [Raksha] still here?</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>These two unknowns could affect the outcome of this fight, </p>
        <p>if the worst possibility is considered, “Eagle” would have no chance of winning even if it’s a gamble</p>
        <p>—If only, he really ends up in the worst case scenario.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>…The situation was so horrible, the chances of winning were nearly zero.</p>
        <p>But “Eagle” had absolute confidence in victory.</p>
        <p />
        <p>Because, he has yet to count his [advantages].</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="left" img="老鹰-微笑-肉搏备战-远景" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="right" img="素裳-浅笑-背剑-远景" duration="2" />
      <delay t="1.5" />
      <text>There are three advantages.</text>
      <dialog chara="015">[Hahahahahaha—]</dialog>
      <text>The man let out a cheerful laugh,</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-狞笑-肉搏备战-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[Amazing! Little girl, good work!]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="015">
        <p>[It should be said that I’ve underestimated you; when I’m old, I should serve the old… </p>
        <p>Snatching stuff from my hands, hehe, not even 100,000 Rakshas could do it.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目前-背剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[Oh… thanks, but this was mine originally. </p>
        <p>I didn’t rob you of anything, it’s called returning to the original owner.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-微笑-肉搏备战-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[Hehehe…]</dialog>
      <text>The man couldn’t help but laugh.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-狞笑-肉搏备战-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[Since it returned to its original owner, why aren’t you leaving?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-惊讶2-背剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[I haven’t beaten you yet, so I can’t go.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-惊讶-肉搏备战-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[......]</dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-狞笑-肉搏备战-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[So… you’re here to kill me.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-惊讶-背剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="002" inline="true">[No no, I haven’t figured that out yet… you could be killed or not. </dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-浅笑-背剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="002">But you still owe me two slaps, so I have to get those fair and square.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="015">[Heh.]</dialog>
      <text>"Eagle" sneered.</text>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Advantage Number One: [Experience]. </p>
        <p />
        <p>Compared to his long time in the Jianghu Society, Li Sushang social experience was near nothing. </p>
        <p>She didn’t find the hints buried in “Eagle”’s words at all, </p>
        <p>only walking into the trap step by step unknowingly. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Advantage Number Two: it’s [Character]. </p>
        <p />
        <p>Eagle had tasted defeat before. In order to win, he would do anything. </p>
        <p>Li Sushang is really an honest and stupid idiot, </p>
        <p>things such as justice and fairness still occupy a high place in her heart.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>If he utilizes the full use of these two advantages,</p>
        <p>And relies on the third advantage.</p>
        <p>Making another bet on the variables.</p>
        <p />
        <p>“Eagle” believes he can tip the balance of victory to lean towards him.</p>
      </mono>
      <dialog chara="015">
        <p>[Fair and square… Good, I want that as well. </p>
        <p>How about this, little girl, let’s gamble.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-惊讶-肉搏备战-远景" />
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-小恶魔-背剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Gambling isn’t good… but do speak, I’m listening.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-微笑-肉搏备战-远景" />
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-浅笑-背剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[Haha, yes.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="015">
        <p>[Let’s do as you wish, and we’ll compete in an honest and fair manner. Just fists, no using weapons. </p>
        <p>If I lose, you can have my head. If you lose, the sword stays.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-专注-背剑-远景" />
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-惊讶-肉搏备战-远景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[That won’t work.]</dialog>
      <text>The girl shook her head,</text>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-浅笑-背剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>[I promised my mother to never let this sword leave my side.</p>
        <p>How about this, if I lose, you can also have my head. Is that fair?]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="015">[......]</dialog>
      <text>“Eagle” was stunned, then he laughed:</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-狞笑-肉搏备战-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[It’s fair! Hahahahaha, very fair, really fucking fair!]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-悲伤目前-背剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Uh… it’s a deal?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-浅笑-背剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="015">[It’s a deal.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="img_trans" img="素裳-大笑-背剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Mm.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <text inline="true">With a toss from Li Sushang’s hand, </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <cg img="氛围_通用_轩辕剑下落" duration="0.5" pos="0,200" scale="2" />
      <delay t="0.3" />
      <se id="01-26大刀向下挥" />
      <text>the Xuanyuan Sword plunged straight through the ground, leaving only the hilt standing abruptly on the ancient green rocks. </text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰惊李抱拳_无剑" scale="2" origin="85%,54%" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Why don’t you let me go first? I’m younger than you.]</dialog>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰惊李抱拳_无剑" duration="0.5" origin="85%,54%" />
      <text>While talking, Sushang activated her Blade Mantra, her heart was Still Water.</text>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="16" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="16" prev="15" title="虎の咆哮">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="BGSky03" />
      <text>The night wind blows, and the silver moon rises high.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <text>Illuminated by the moonlight, a single shadow formed. The second silhouette overlapped on top of it in an even more flickering candle flame</text>
      <text>The shadow twisted, changing into various shapes. It looked very comical to me</text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-2" duration="2" scale="1" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <text>Meanwhile, the shadow masters didn’t budge an inch.</text>
      <cg img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-2" duration="10" pos="0,120" scale="1.3" />
      <text>The girl readies herself as if she's holding a sword in her left hand, then clenches it with the right. This is 「Zangetsu」—the first stance of Edge of Taixuan-gata (The Void Blade).[\s]And she’d decided that the first attack would be Type 6 「Taruenjuusan」 of Li Family「Uen Shuanggui」.</text>
      <text inline="true">The girl stood tall boldly, enjoying her first official other-style match in life.</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>The flickering candlelight illuminated a young girl in the darkness of night, making her look much larger than she actually was.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg duration="1" img="CG_第一折_老鹰战姿_拳" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <cg duration="10" img="CG_第一折_老鹰战姿_拳" pos="0,120" scale="1.3" />
      <text>
        <p>Meanwhile, the man in front of him was leaning forward faintly and bending his back—his legs; both arms.[\s]</p>
        <p>This stance is 「Tiger Howl Qixiao」, a secret technique passed down through the Katou Luo clan.</p>
      </text>
      <text>If someone from the martial arts world were here, they would have wondered why a leader of Golden Sand Society was learning Katomon school’s Martial Arts.[\s]However, a girl who knew next to nothing about the martial arts world had no way of knowing that</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="4" />
      <cg img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-2" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2.01" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_老鹰战姿_拳" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2.01" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The man and the girl stood facing each other, probing at one another without moving an inch.</p>
        <p />
        <p>Tonight's moonlit silence enveloped the small courtyard.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站院内" duration="3" />
      <cg />
      <bg img="PureBlack" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Would this kind of silence always befall the East before duels?</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>……</p>
        <p />
        <p>They were both looking for an opening in their opponent.</p>
        <p />
        <p>However, the third person was somewhat numb.</p>
      </mono>
      <dialog chara="099">「The way Shinshu people think...」</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="4" />
      <cg img="氛围_通用_犹大誓约" duration="4" />
      <delay t="4" />
      <text>That person is playing with a small cross in his hand.</text>
      <dialog chara="099">「It would still take some time for me to understand.」</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <cg img="氛围_通用_犹大誓约" duration="3" scale="2" />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <se id="01-01白光转场" />
      <bgm id="传奇诞生" />
      <cg duration="1" img="氛围_通用_犹大誓约启动" reset="true" />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <text>He tossed his cross into the air, watching it disappear like mist.</text>
      <transition mode="dissolve" in="2" stop="0.2" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <cg duration="1" />
      <transition mode="move" in="0" stop="0.3" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <se id="01-30女孩轻功whoosh_02" />
      <text>—At the same time, a girl suddenly launched an attack.</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_老鹰战姿_拳" />
      <text>After facing it for so long, "Eagle" finally showed an opening.</text>
      <text inline="true">The opening was only for a moment. His breathing had become just slightly ragged</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>In that moment, Majic's movements stagnated and Koku lost his stance.</p>
      </text>
      <se id="01-30女孩轻功whoosh_02" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-特写-惊讶" />
      <dialog chara="015">（...Dammit!）</dialog>
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" img="李素裳-特写-自信" />
      <dialog chara="002">「...!」</dialog>
      <cg />
      <motion chara="096" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="right" custom="default" />
      <cg img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-1" />
      <text>Li Sushang didn't miss her chance and leaped forward!</text>
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="900" direction="horizontal" />
      <se id="01-30女孩轻功whoosh_02" />
      <cg duration="0.1" />
      <text>—Her fists are like the wind, her palms of lightning!</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="0.5" />
      <bg img="刀光与剑影" duration="0.5" />
      <se id="01-44耳光重" />
      <bg img="BGBlood1" duration="0.5" />
      <text>
        <p>*bang*![\s]</p>
        <p>The sound of a slap rang out.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="015" action="shake" direction="default" duration="1" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站院内" />
      <motion action="show" pos="center" duration="1" chara="015" img="老鹰-惊讶-受伤擦血-中景" />
      <text>"Eagle" staggers and takes a step back. Blood flows from her mouth</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <se id="01-56老鹰咳咳" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <se id="01-60吐血小" />
      <text>He spat several times. The salty, bitter liquid slammed into the stone floor along with his shattered teeth</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" duration="0.5" />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰血李普通2" />
      <dialog chara="002">「This is my first slap, after all.」</dialog>
      <text>The girl smiled as she spoke.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">「I'll return the second shot, so be careful.」</dialog>
      <motion chara="096" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-特写-惊讶（带血）" />
      <dialog chara="015">「......」</dialog>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>"Eagle" couldn't calm her anger.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>The girl had slapped him just as he’d made the mistake of moving his mind and lost consciousness for a moment.</p>
        <p />
        <p>Though he hadn’t suffered much damage, this blunder left him feeling ashamed.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>However, it seems that Li Sushang has not gone all out yet.</p>
        <p />
        <p>This gives me more confidence in 「Variable」. At the same time, it doubles my sense of humiliation</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>He hadn't used 「Koko Isao」 in a long time. It was my first use of it since I last saw him, but he still seemed to be rusty after all[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>The enemy was not an opponent he could afford to let his guard down and win. He would never make the same mistake again</p>
      </mono>
      <bgm id="火燃" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" img="李素裳-特写-坚定" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <dialog chara="002">「One more time!」</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="096" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <motion action="hide" chara="097" duration="0" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" range="400" direction="vertical" duration="0.3" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰血李飞" duration="0" />
      <se id="01-22女孩轻功whoosh_01" />
      <text>Sushang used 「Surprise Tsubame Futsuren」 again and vanished in the blink of an eye.</text>
      <cg />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="right" custom="default" />
      <bg img="速度线左右1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1.5" />
      <se id="01-64战斗-拳打1" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="left" img="横劈-弧度(透明) " />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="400" direction="horizontal" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="横劈-右左(透明) " />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="400" direction="vertical" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="对战特效" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="400" direction="default" />
      <text>
        <p>The two of them unleashed three techniques in midair.</p>
        <p>Their power was equal, and neither side had the upper hand.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <delay t="0.3" />
      <se id="01-30女孩轻功whoosh_02" />
      <cg img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-1" duration="0.5" pos="100,100" scale="1.5" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <cg img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-1" duration="0.3" />
      <text>The girl landed gracefully, then unleashed 「Keiken Zangetsu」 again.</text>
      <cg />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" img="李素裳-特写-艰难" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The roar of the tiger surprised Tsubame as she flew.[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>The Hedong Luo family's Hufeng Jiuxiao has long been famous for its bravery</p>
        <p>The Type 13 Suien was light and varied, each with their own strengths.[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>However, the girl who should have been winning in terms of raw power was barely evenly matched against "Eagle".</p>
        <p>This itself was an unbelievable stump.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="097" action="img_trans" img="李素裳-特写-闭眼" duration="0.5" />
      <mono chara="002">（...Why?）</mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>"Eagle" won the bet.</p>
        <p>Ever since the battle began, Li Sushang had been unable to use her true feelings.</p>
        <p>The reason she continued to take the form of Taixuankeiken after her family tradition, Tarien Jusanshiki...</p>
        <p>That was exactly what she wanted to confirm.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono chara="002" pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>（That medicine shouldn't be working on me...）</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="心湖（1）止水" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>In terms of her inner strength, 「Taixuan」 at the Jizaimon gate was probably number one in all Japan.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Each faction in Shinshu has their own unique way of thinking. However, even though the formalities have changed and its essence remains unchanged—it all comes down to training</p>
        <p />
        <p>If one were to compare Majic with water, a normal Uchiko would be like training the vessel for putting it in and increasing its capacity.[\s]</p>
        <p>Not only do I have to undergo harsh training, but my improvement is also extremely slow. And above all else there's a risk of putting too much strain on the human body</p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="心湖（2）无尘" duration="2" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>On the other hand, 「Taixuan」 is fundamentally different from all others.[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>「Blade Mantra」 trains not「Vessel」, 「Sandou」 but percentA.</p>
        <p />
        <p>It absorbs the true power from all things in heaven and earth, allowing its internal merit to flow freely within itself like a stream of water.</p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="心湖（3）明镜" duration="2" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>This new method was created by Phoenix, the founder of Taixuanichimyaku.</p>
        <p>It was deep and mysterious, but there were also very large restrictions.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true" inline="true">
        <p />
        <p>For example, if a man were to train his Edge of Taixuan (Void Blade), the majority of them would be discouraged midway through their training and wouldn't get any better. It was impossible for anyone other than an exceptionally talented young boy to learn such feats as he did</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>On the other hand, if a woman trains her Taixuan (Vengeance of Wisdom), she can achieve great results with little effort.</p>
        <p>Even someone with ordinary talent could obtain enough strength to beat a man in handiwork.</p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="心湖（4）太虚" duration="2" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Master Sushang was said to be the strongest swordsman in history, and if it were just for her inner merit alone she would have been unbeatable by anyone else on Earth.</p>
        <p />
        <p>The girl she had taught him also possessed extraordinary skills.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" duration="3" />
      <text>But right now, it's a situation where the meritocracy is sealed----</text>
      <bg img="废弃驿站" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-惊讶-肉搏百裂拳-中景" />
      <se id="01-66战斗-拳打3" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="200" direction="horizontal" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="横劈-左右2(爪痕，透明)" />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="横劈-左右(透明) " />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="200" direction="vertical" />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="横劈-弧度(透明) " />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="400" direction="default" />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" />
      <text>Heavy fists came at the girl in rapid succession.</text>
      <text>Thanks to her extraordinary reflexes and intuition, Li Sushang had avoided each one of "Eagle"’s attacks—and blocked them as well.</text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" img="李素裳-特写-睁眼" />
      <dialog chara="002" inline="true">（I can’t underestimate his martial arts...</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="img_trans" img="李素裳-特写-自信" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p />
        <p>But even so, I'm the one who wins.）</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" />
      <text>The members of the Golden Sand Society who had fought so far only swung their weapons around with brute force, but "Eagle" was different. This man knew not just how to use his fists; he also used seriousness and strength in a way that strengthened one's knuckles—he clearly possessed extraordinary Uchiko skills</text>
      <text>
        <p>But even if she couldn’t use her true self, the girl still had an absolute advantage.</p>
        <p>The strength of the body that had trained her swordsmanship was far greater than a normal person.</p>
        <p>And sword form is the most profound martial art in this world.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <se id="01-65战斗-拳打2" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="300" direction="vertical" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="left" img="横劈-左右(爪痕，透明)" />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" direction="horizontal" duration="0.1" range="300" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="right" img="横劈-右左(透明) " />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="300" direction="default" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="对战特效" />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <text inline="true">「Shuken: Taruyanagi」!</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>The large man unleashed a fist heavy as rain, but Li Sushang was barely able to block it with just the form of her set sword.</p>
      </text>
      <text>But even so, Kokoku's fists continue to attack without rest. It feels like the raging waves are constantly beating against her as she slowly takes a step back from where I am holding my sword with one hand and overpowering his steel punches in other words...</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" img="李素裳-特写-艰难" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <dialog chara="002">（Hey... Don't you know how tired this falcon is?）</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-特写-胜利（带血）" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <dialog chara="015">「Oh?」</dialog>
      <se id="01-67战斗-拳打4" />
      <text>
        <p>The leader of the Golden Sand Society didn’t seem tired at all.</p>
        <p>Even as the girl stretched out like a willow, her fist was blocked with all its might...</p>
        <p>She didn’t let up on her attack for a moment.</p>
      </text>
      <text>The shadow of a flood-like fist rushed at Li Sushang.</text>
      <text>Now that he had no internal strength to protect his body, taking this heavy blow would easily break him like a dead branch.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="img_trans" img="李素裳-特写-坚定" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <dialog chara="002">（No, there was no opening in the shape of a defensive sword.）</dialog>
      <text>Such thoughts grazed Li Sushang’s head, but they didn't make a ripple and were quickly erased.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>（I've seen through most of his punches. The Type-Six sword can handle them well enough to dodge any blows that might come my way...</p>
        <p>...Still, if she's wasting this much of her power like that... it should naturally weaken.）</p>
      </dialog>
      <text>
        <p>There was no way "Eagle" wouldn’t understand such simple logic.[\s]</p>
        <p>But why would he continue his onslaught as usual?</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="097" action="img_trans" img="李素裳-特写-睁眼" />
      <dialog chara="002">（Honestly. Let's wait a little longer...）</dialog>
      <text>Under the restriction of losing his inner merit, Li Sushang was hesitant to carelessly lay a hand on him</text>
      <text>As she waited for her chance,[\s]I waited for an opening.</text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="17" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="17" prev="16" title="破綻">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="火燃" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_老鹰战姿_拳血" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <text>
        <p>"Eagle" was also looking for an opportunity, </p>
        <p>He intends to take the initiative to expose openings.</p>
      </text>
      <cg />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="right" custom="default" />
      <bg img="BGSky03" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-特写-微笑（带血）" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>The openings were also easy to find, just on his own cheeks.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" img="李素裳-特写-睁眼" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>
        <p>"Eagle" had already figured out the girl's temperament, </p>
        <p>and if she didn't ask for that "slap", the girl's target of attack would never turn elsewhere.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>If the enemy's intention was known, </p>
        <p>the intention was no longer a life gate, but a life-saving talisman.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="096" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="move" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_老鹰战姿_掌血" />
      <text>
        <p>While attacking with full force, "Eagle" only needs to guard the top of the shoulder. </p>
        <p>At the same time, he was struggling with life and death, but his pressure was much lighter than Li Sushang.</p>
      </text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_老鹰战姿_拳血" duration="1" />
      <text>
        <p>Of course, he didn't plan to fulfill any "gambling contract", </p>
        <p>Xuanyuan would stay, and Li Sushang's life would be forfeit. [\s]</p>
        <p>For this reason, what’s one more slap?</p>
      </text>
      <text>From the beginning, this was an unequal battle.</text>
      <cg duration="1" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>
        <p>"Eagle" did everything possible and exhausted his housekeeping skills. The purpose was not to injure the enemy, </p>
        <p>but to get close to the place where the ancient sword [Xuanyuan] was located.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_夺剑_SWORD" duration="2" pos="-100,250" scale="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>As soon as the two sides fought, "Eagle" knew that this girl was young but her skills were appallingly deep.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Not to mention strength and speed, but this was the skill of changing moves freely under Roaring Tiger, and it could be counted as a first-class player in the martial arts.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>For this alone, he was far from matching against her.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>If you continue to fight for a long time, you will undoubtedly lose.</p>
        <p> ——If you follow the rules.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>"Eagle" wasn’t a person who obeys the rules. [\s]</p>
        <p>What he wants is not to win, but to conquer.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>This was the third advantage: "purpose." The same was "victory." </p>
        <p />
        <p>The "victory" of "Eagle" was completely different from the "victory" of Li Sushang.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>What the girl pursued was the victory of the "match." </p>
        <p>What "Eagle" wants is the victory of the "war."</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p>"Victory of the war"... means getting what you want, destroying what you want to destroy. </p>
        <p />
        <p>Li Sushang obeyed the rules. </p>
        <p>But "Eagle" uses rules. </p>
        <p />
        <p>Use the opponent's "target" to protect oneself, </p>
        <p>use one’s own "flaws" to lure the enemy, </p>
        <p>and then use that sharp "sword" to kill.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg duration="1" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" pos="0,-1080" duration="0" img="老鹰-特写-狞笑（带血）" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <motion chara="096" action="move" pos="0,0" duration="1" />
      <text>
        <p>This was the trap set by "Eagle". [\s]</p>
        <p>So far, every step has met his expectations,</p>
      </text>
      <text>The layout is perfect.</text>
      <motion chara="096" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="竖劈-上下(透明) " />
      <se id="01-66战斗-拳打3" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="对战特效" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="横劈-右左(透明) " />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="横劈-左右(爪痕，透明)" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="700" direction="default" />
      <delay t="0.6" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <text>Sushang receded slowly, but from the lighter movements and expressions, he judged that the girl had become accustomed to her own boxing.</text>
      <text>The scale of victory and defeat won’t always lean towards one side, and the weight that symbolizes superiority changes all the time.</text>
      <text>The result of this battle must be determined within a few seconds.</text>
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_夺剑_SWORD" pos="-100,250" scale="2" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1.6" />
      <se id="01-67战斗-拳打4" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="600" direction="horizontal" />
      <delay t="0.8" />
      <se id="01-64战斗-拳打1" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="699" direction="vertical" />
      <delay t="0.8" />
      <se id="01-66战斗-拳打3" />
      <text>The tiger's roar never stopped.</text>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_夺剑_SWORD" duration="0.5" pos="0,250" scale="2" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <text>He kept pushing, approaching the "Xuanyuan"...</text>
      <cg duration="0.5" pos="-200,250" scale="2" img="CG_第一折_夺剑_SWORD" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <text>
        <p>The sword was inserted on the bluestone ground beside him. [\s]</p>
        <p>At his fingertips…</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg duration="1" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" img="老鹰-特写-胜利（带血）" duration="1" pos="center" />
      <text>
        <p>"Eagle" released his left hand. [\s]</p>
        <p>The layout has been completed and the net is ready to be closed.</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="18" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="18" prev="17" title="帰還">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="火燃" />
      <cg img="CG_通用_李素裳战斗-1" duration="2" />
      <text>Such battles were far from what Li Sushang had initially imagined.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <cg duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>
        <p>There was absolutely nothing he’d hoped for—his special attack, his skill strategy and every move forward or backward.</p>
        <p>All they had was a rush of surging waves, impatiently monotonous attacks and defense that gradually formed traps.</p>
      </text>
      <text>...This wasn't the sparring match Li Sushang had envisioned.</text>
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" duration="1" img="李素裳-特写-张口" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Her eyes were already used to "Eagle"’s kenjutsu</p>
        <p>Continue to observe with 「Blade Mantra」, and even the Hulu Zhenxiao</p>
        <p>I found a way to fight back.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="097" action="img_trans" img="李素裳-特写-睁眼" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>That's when the new 「An opening」 arrives.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" />
      <delay t="0.2" />
      <cg />
      <bg img="刀光与剑影" />
      <se id="01-67战斗-拳打4" />
      <text>
        <p>"Eagle"’s right fist was completely powerless, clearly a diversion.[\s]</p>
        <p>However, the diversion wasn’t meant to lure in enemies or defend against them—it was actually a half-assed move that only gave her enough time for preparations</p>
      </text>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <se id="01-53少女拳" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="横劈-左右2(爪痕，透明)" />
      <text>
        <p>Sushang has been waiting for that brief moment.</p>
        <p>With Type 1 「Kaken: Kumotaka」, she switched from defense to offense</p>
        <p>In an instant, I pull out 「Open Sword: Instant Dust」 and stab it into"Eagle"'s throat.</p>
      </text>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>The sword of the Void Sword extends with its physical form.[\s]</p>
        <p>When you have a sword in your hand, this technique becomes merciless kenjutsu that aims straight for the enemy’s throat by imbuing them with true energy</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>With the godlike speed of Li Sushang, there was no other way for her opponent to do anything but force this sword.</p>
        <p>She used her fingers instead of a sword, preparing for "Eagle"’s return move.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站院内" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="015" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-微笑-受伤擦血-近景" duration="1" />
      <text>
        <p>However, "Eagle" neither defended nor evaded.[\s]</p>
        <p>Not only that, but his upper body was left empty and wide open.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="015" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-特写-胜利（带血）" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" img="李素裳-特写-惊讶" />
      <dialog chara="002">（Huh...!?）</dialog>
      <text>Sushang is very surprised. I didn't expect this turn of events to happen...</text>
      <text>If the enemy showed an opening of their own, they either gave up on resisting or were prepared to throw themselves away and attack.</text>
      <text>
        <p>The closer we get to victory, the more dangerous it becomes.</p>
        <p>When a situation arises between life and death, people are often able to act in unexpected ways.</p>
      </text>
      <text>However, for a moment there was too much worry about the other person in Sushang's mind and confusion.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" duration="1" img="李素裳-特写-艰难" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <dialog chara="002">（I'm going to kill this person...）</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>「Shunjin」 was extremely fast, and it didn't give her time to think.</p>
        <p>The sword extends with its physical form. If "Eagle" doesn't respond, it will probably die in an instant!</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="096" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.2" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <bg img="速度线前后3" />
      <text>
        <p>Just in the nick of time, Li Sushang suddenly realized something.</p>
        <p>To tell the truth, she hadn't been prepared for this until now.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>She didn’t have the resolve to wield a sword, fight her way out of this mess or kill anyone...</p>
        <p>She was nothing more than a fifteen-year old girl who thought she’d stepped into the martial arts world, but in reality hadn't abandoned her feelings of respect for people and their lives.</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">「--!」</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>In front of the evildoer who is about to die at his own hands...</p>
        <p>The promise of betting her head, payback for the slap—everything vanished from my mind in an instant.</p>
        <p>Li Sushang gritted her teeth and decided to pull back the technique—</p>
      </text>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <se id="01-30女孩轻功whoosh_02" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <text>
        <p>I forcibly push back the emptiness of my sword.</p>
        <p>The power of my recoil fingers returned to me, and a great pain ran through the arm.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>To disperse the power of her technique, she lightly tapped on his toes</p>
        <p>All I could do was cast 「Hien homing」 and use the rotation to whittle down its power.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="竖劈（无色）" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" delay="0.2" />
      <se id="01-27大刀横挥" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>
        <p>Just then, a rustling sound rang out at my feet.</p>
        <p>A streak of white light glittered before my eyes, slicing through the space where I’d just been standing.</p>
      </text>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" pos="center" img="老鹰-特写-惊讶（带血）" />
      <dialog chara="015">「Tch!」</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>At the same time as Sushang pulled back her technique...</p>
        <p>"Eagle"’s left hand suddenly pulled out「Hekihan」 and slashed upward.</p>
        <p>If the girl hadn’t stepped back, her body would have been cut in half with a single slash.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" img="李素裳-特写-惊讶" />
      <text>
        <p>There was no telling if Li Sushang’s kindness had been correct or not</p>
        <p>There was no doubt that she had saved her own life.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" />
      <motion action="hide" chara="096" img="老鹰-狞笑-拔刀预备-近景" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_抢剑_鹰挥刀" scale="2" origin="20%,30%" />
      <text>The sword comes at me. What Li Sushang sees in midair is "Eagle", wearing a cruel smile she can't hide</text>
      <motion chara="096" action="show" pos="center" duration="1" img="老鹰-特写-狞笑" />
      <dialog chara="015">「...I won't let you get away!」</dialog>
      <cg />
      <motion action="hide" chara="096" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1.1" />
      <se id="01-26大刀向下挥" />
      <bg img="轩辕剑_灯光00%" duration="1" scale="2" pos="0,200" />
      <delay t="1.01" />
      <text>"Eagle" lunges at her. The treasured sword in my hand, the hanging sword reflected a blinding light as it swung down like lightning</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2.1" />
      <se id="01-21轩辕剑氛围声" />
      <bg img="轩辕剑_灯光35%" duration="1" scale="2" pos="0,200" />
      <delay t="1.01" />
      <bg img="轩辕剑_灯光99%" scale="2" duration="1" pos="0,200" />
      <delay t="1.01" />
      <mono chara="002">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>（Is that the light of a candle? Or is it moonlight）</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Just before his death, Li Sushang suddenly thought.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="6" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="2" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#ffffff" />
      <bg img="心湖（3）明镜" duration="3.5" />
      <delay t="1.5" />
      <bgm id="佛心禅悟" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" img="李素裳-大特写-闭眼" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <dialog chara="002">（Don't you think they might be interested in something else?）</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>The swordsmanship he had mastered over ten years of training was very calm.[\s]</p>
        <p>The girl had never faced death before, but on the verge of dying she felt so empty.</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>（Ah, I lost-[\s]</p>
        <p>Not just losing, but dying.）</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>（I can’t kill people without mercy,</p>
        <p>I can't even get back at her for slapping me.</p>
        <p>Having no experience in the martial arts world really is fatal, huh?）</p>
      </dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="img_trans" img="李素裳-大特写-张口" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <dialog chara="002">
        <p>（Master, I'm sorry.</p>
        <p>Mom, I'm sorry.</p>
        <p>Sushang, I-）</p>
      </dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="4" />
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" />
      <se id="01-01白光转场" />
      <bg img="心湖（1）止水" duration="4" />
      <delay t="4" />
      <text>The girl’s thoughts floated quietly in the lake of her sword heart like fallen leaves, making small waves.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" img="李素裳-大特写-闭眼" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <text>The next moment, Sushang thought she heard a rippling echo in the center of Kokoro’s lake.</text>
      <dialog chara="099">「...For my sake.」</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>It was a woman's voice.</p>
        <p>I can hear it from afar, far away...</p>
      </text>
      <text>[em italic]Eh, who...?[/em]</text>
      <dialog chara="009">「I'm going to live. Sushang, you will be living a proper life... Promises with my mother!」</dialog>
      <text>[em italic]Mom's voice...[/em]</text>
      <dialog chara="009">「Promise me!」</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3.3" />
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <bg img="BGPureWhite00" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <motion chara="097" action="img_trans" duration="0.1" img="李素裳-大特写-睁眼" />
      <delay t="0.3" />
      <transition mode="dissolve" in="1" stop="0.1" out="0.3" color="#FFFFFF" />
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" />
      <bgm id="火燃" />
      <text>The girl was still hazy, but her body moved instinctively.</text>
      <bg img="CG_第一折_夺剑_BG" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="对战特效" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" delay="0.5" />
      <se id="01-22女孩轻功whoosh_01" />
      <text>The mo transformed the Hien homing rotation into thrust and launched an attack at a speed even I couldn’t believe was happening.</text>
      <text>The girl usually boasted about her speed, but the way these fingers moved was so fast that even she couldn’t accurately catch their shape.</text>
      <transition mode="move" in="0.5" stop="0.2" out="0.5" color="#000000" direction="left" custom="default" />
      <bg img="轩辕剑_灯光99%" pos="0,200" scale="2" />
      <text>It was exactly like lightning... No, faster than a bolt of light!</text>
      <text>
        <p>She caught the blade of her sword just a short distance away from my body.[\s]</p>
        <p>Next, I flicked it with my finger.</p>
      </text>
      <bg img="PureBlack" duration="0" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <se id="01-55手指弹剑" />
      <bg img="轩辕剑-上升" pos="0,300" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <bg img="轩辕剑-上升" duration="30" pos="0,-900" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <text inline="true">The girl's consciousness is very clear. Even when she has mastered the art of swordplay, her movements are so efficient that I could not wield them without wasting my energy at all!</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>The movements of these fingers were perfect, on par with my old master’s.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="goto" to="19" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="19" type="block" prev="18" title="帰還2">
      <bg />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_夺剑_SWORD" duration="10" />
      <text>The treasured sword leaves "Eagle"'s hand and flies through the air.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <motion action="show" pos="center" chara="096" img="老鹰-特写-惊讶" />
      <cg />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.3" range="95" direction="default" />
      <bg img="BGBlood1" />
      <se id="01-28胸口命中" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>"Eagle" was furious. She flicked off Sushang with a palm strike, then ran to catch the sword</text>
      <motion chara="096" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_夺剑_SWORD" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" img="老鹰-动作-夺剑" pos="-250,0" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <motion chara="096" action="move" pos="0,0" duration="30" />
      <text>This time, he seemed to underestimate the girl's Hienko.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2.5" />
      <motion chara="096" action="hide" />
      <cg />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.5" range="25" direction="default" />
      <se id="01-34男沙地重摔" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="right" img="素裳-战损无血-振作-单手-近景" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <se id="01-60吐血小" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>The girl fell to the stone floor and coughed up blood from her mouth, but she immediately spun around after being hit by a recoil.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" />
      <se id="01-22女孩轻功whoosh_01" />
      <motion chara="100" action="show" pos="center" img="轩辕剑-剑柄朝上" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" pos="-250,0" img="老鹰-动作-夺剑" />
      <bg img="CG_第一折_夺剑_BG" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="300,0" duration="1" img="素裳-动作-夺剑" />
      <text>The next moment, she leapt into the air.</text>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <se id="01-30女孩轻功whoosh_02" />
      <motion chara="096" action="move" pos="0,0" duration="30" />
      <motion chara="097" action="move" pos="120,0" duration="30" />
      <motion chara="100" action="move" pos="0,-50" duration="30" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>
        <p>Their objective is the old sword 「Hekihan」.[\s]</p>
        <p>The one who gets it wins, and the ones that can't die.</p>
      </text>
      <mono chara="002">
        <p />
        <p>（...You're going to help me, right?）</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>I completely let my instincts control the movement of her body.</p>
        <p>「A girl.」's Li Sushang consciousness murmured.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono chara="002" pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>「You're my sword...」</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <motion chara="100" action="move" pos="-25,100" duration="30" />
      <motion chara="096" action="move" pos="-100,0" duration="30" />
      <motion chara="097" action="move" pos="50,0" duration="30" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>The kenjou reached its highest position and stopped for a moment, then immediately fell.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Suddenly, a very nostalgic feeling welled up inside Li Sushang.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Have I seen this before?[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>Why is the sword falling in front of me so friendly?[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>…………</p>
        <p>Years ago.</p>
        <p>…………</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="096" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="100" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_抢剑_李ONLY" scale="2" pos="-200,200" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_抢剑_李ONLY" scale="3" pos="-50,200" duration="20" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>
        <p>My fingers moved closer to the hilt of my sword.</p>
        <p>It was as if the sound of clashing swords rang in her head.</p>
        <p>At that very moment, Li Sushang was convinced she had mastered 「Ken'i」.</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="dissolve" in="0.5" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <se id="01-21轩辕剑氛围声" />
      <text>Clang----</text>
      <se id="01-21轩辕剑氛围声" looptimes="0" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="7" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_抢剑_鹰WIN" scale="3" pos="100,150" />
      <se id="01-57接住剑柄" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <cg />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" img="老鹰-特写-狞笑" pos="center" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" img="李素裳-特写-惊讶" pos="center" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_抢剑_鹰挥刀" duration="2" scale="2" origin="20%,0" />
      <motion chara="096" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <text>However, it wasn’t she who gripped the hilt of her sword</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="0.8" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" pos="0,-1080" img="老鹰-特写-狞笑（带血）" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <motion chara="096" action="move" pos="center" duration="0.3" />
      <delay t="0.3" />
      <dialog chara="015">「I won!」</dialog>
      <text>What reached my ears were words declaring death.</text>
      <dialog chara="015">「Die, girl-」</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="show" pos="center" img="李素裳-特写-濒死" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <dialog chara="002">「......」</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The despair and disappointment at this moment was greater than ever before.[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>The girl is not afraid to die.[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>However, he had gained hope and lost it. He’d experienced the agony of climbing up to a peak before falling down</p>
        <p>Along with a great regret that seemed to sink into my body.</p>
        <p>The screams and trembling never ceased.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="097" action="img_trans" img="李素裳-特写-坚定" duration="1" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>「—No!」</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="0.5" stop="0.2" out="0.5" color="#FFFFFF" />
      <bgm id="传奇诞生" />
      <bg img="BGPureWhite00" duration="0" />
      <motion chara="096" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <motion chara="097" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_抢剑_鹰挥刀" scale="4" origin="99%,10%" />
      <text>
        <p>The next moment, even if she was about to be cut in half with a single slash...</p>
        <p>My instincts refused to admit defeat.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <cg duration="0.5" origin="99%,10%" img="CG_第一折_抢剑_鹰挥刀" />
      <delay t="0.5" />
      <text>
        <p>Her extremely hazy consciousness pushed out her bare palm sword</p>
        <p>He desperately attacked the enemy, intending to strike a mutual blow.</p>
      </text>
      <cg duration="5" />
      <text>
        <p>In this moment, the girl who understood and accepted 「Death.」...</p>
        <p>Finally, one step too late...</p>
      </text>
      <text>「Prepare yourself.」.</text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="3" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="20" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="20" prev="19" title="鷹の折">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_抢剑_鹰挥刀" scale="1.8" origin="0%,0%" />
      <bgm id="国势倾危（燃）" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>“Eagle” wasn’t a swordsman, but a soldier.</p>
        <p />
        <p>What he uses isn’t swords, but greatswords.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Thus, whenever he holds the handle backward, he habitually turns his wrist, </p>
        <p>so that the side of the blade edge, faced the enemy. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>But tonight——[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>Tonight, at this moment between life and death, </p>
        <p>“Eagle” had a strange idea.[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>This idea took root and sprouted unknowingly when he sword danced earlier. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono chara="015" pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>(Swords are double edged, unlike greatswords…)</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>This was just an idea, but it was lingering.[\s]</p>
        <p>This was just an idea, but it prompted “Eagle” to give up the habit of turning his wrists at the critical moment of life and death. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>This saved him a split moment of time.[\s]</p>
        <p>Without this split moment, he would’ve died before the blade could’ve reached the girl. </p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg duration="2" />
      <bg img="刀光与剑影" duration="2" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Like a bolt of lightning, the girl’s palm rushed towards his head.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>"Eagle" held the hilt of the sword and picked it up with the back of his hand. [\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>Swords are unlike greatswords. Swords had double edges, regardless of front and back. </p>
        <p>Though, it only spared him a split moment of time, but the end results are quite different.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <bg img="素裳死亡" duration="0" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <se id="01-26大刀向下挥" />
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="100" direction="default" />
      <delay t="0.8" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>The sword slashed the mud flicked across the moonlight. [\s]</p>
        <p>Its edge gently touched, penetrated, and bid farewell to the girl's body, dividing her into two. </p>
        <p />
        <p>It's as easy as cutting a piece of thin paper.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Her gaze froze staring blankly in the void, no longer moving; [\s]</p>
        <p>And that fatal palm blade stopped dead in its track midair, no longer having power to move. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>"Eagle" killed the girl and took her sword. </p>
        <p />
        <p>Though hard, though cruel, it was a victory after all.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>-It should be so.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="2" stop="0.5" out="2" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>But when the point of the sword was about to stab Li Sushang's waist, "Eagle"’s Ki suddenly disappeared.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The tyrannical inner strength that he had cultivated over the years was gone, as if it had never been born. [\s]</p>
        <p>No matter how he tries to summon it, there is no response in the empty meridians.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2.1" />
      <motion chara="096" action="show" pos="right" duration="0.1" img="老鹰-特写-微笑（带血）" />
      <delay t="0.1" />
      <motion chara="096" action="img_trans" img="老鹰-特写-惊讶（带血）" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <bgm id="原始武士" looptimes="0" />
      <mono chara="015">
        <p />
        <p>[em italic]Impossible–[/em]</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>A cold current named fear instantly flows through the blood veins of "Eagle".</p>
      </mono>
      <mono chara="015" pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>[em italic]Impossible impossible impossible impossible impossible impossible impossible impossible impossible impossible——[/em]</p>
      </mono>
      <motion action="hide" duration="1" chara="096" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>There was absolutely no problem with his breathing and Ki, </p>
        <p>He was also sure that he would never get corrupted this moment. [\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>But, the impossible just happened, right when he was about to win.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>This was the second time tonight,</p>
        <p />
        <p>"Eagle" suddenly understood something, but it was too late…</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3.1" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="show" pos="center" img="竖劈（无色）" />
      <se id="01-27大刀横挥" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <motion chara="-5" action="hide" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <se id="01-02大剑命中" />
      <bg img="BGBlood1" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The sudden loss of his Ki made him barely capable of holding onto the handle as he swung.</p>
        <p />
        <p>"Xuanyuan" sliced the girl’s shadow, the tip was embedded deeply in a visible wound, and she was out of his grasp.</p>
      </mono>
      <motion chara="-4" action="shake" duration="0.1" range="420" direction="horizontal" />
      <se id="01-44耳光重" />
      <se id="01-29下颚命中" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The girl's palm hit his cheek. [\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>Accompanied by the sound of slaps and bone cracks, was great pain and unwillingness.</p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="PureBlack" duration="1" />
      <mono chara="015">
        <p />
        <p>[em italic]Why?[/em]</p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Darkness rushed to embrace him from the shattered half of the skull, but he tried his best to resist... His eyes spun frantically, searching for...</p>
      </mono>
      <mono chara="015" pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>[em italic]Why-[/em]</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="eye" in="2" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2.6" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="0" stop="0.5" out="2.5" color="#000000" />
      <bgm id="十大恶人（阴谋）" />
      <bg img="奥托现身1" duration="2.5" />
      <delay t="2.5" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>He saw. [\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>Far away, in the drawing room of the broken post, in front of his favorite chair, a man stood.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.2" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="奥托现身2" />
      <mono chara="015">
        <p />
        <p>[em italic]Raksha…[/em]</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Beside this man, a coffin stood quietly.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono chara="015">
        <p />
        <p>[em italic]It was you……[/em]</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The man looked at him in the distance. The candlelight flickered, and he struggled to look around, trying to see the man’s expression clearly--</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3.1" />
      <bg img="奥托现身3" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <mono chara="015">
        <p />
        <p>[em italic]IT WAS YOU!!!!!![/em]</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" duration="0.1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>
        <p>His thinking only had time to get here. </p>
        <p>His anger had just risen, before the darkness grabbed him and took him away.</p>
      </text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="3" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <event action="goto" to="21" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="21" prev="20" title="黒淵白花">
      <transition mode="eye" in="0" stop="0.5" out="3" color="#000000" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_黑渊白花1" />
      <bg img="BGSky03" />
      <bgm id="红颜近落霞（慢哀）" />
      <text>
        <p>Pain and exhaustion overwhelmed the girl’s body, reminding her that she was in control of her body once more.[\s]</p>
        <p>… A rather cruel reminder, anyway.</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">[It hurts…]</dialog>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>The salty tang of blood in her mouth caused the girl to contemplate her life.[\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>Were her internals ruptured?</p>
        <p>… Her slashed stomach continued to periodically send signals of pain.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The way of the sword was no stranger to injuries, </p>
        <p>but it was the first time the girl had suffered these kinds of injuries.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>[em italic color=#FAFAD2]If this is what victory tastes like… </p>
        <p>then it’s so bitter.[/em][\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>Li Sushang couldn’t help but let her mind run wild, even letting out a chuckle despite the resultant pain.</p>
        <p>And once again, she grimaced in pain.</p>
      </mono>
      <dialog chara="002">[...Hey Raksha, you’re there, right?]</dialog>
      <text>The girl tried her hardest to speak, asking the moon up above.</text>
      <se id="01-68奥托脚步声" />
      <text>
        <p>Nobody answered her. However, she heard the pattering of footsteps-[\s]</p>
        <p>Knock, knock.[\s]</p>
        <p>-as someone neared her.</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Hehe… It’s you, right?]</dialog>
      <se looptimes="0" />
      <text>
        <p>Li Sushang asked, </p>
        <p>but her voice was too quiet, so much so that she couldn’t even hear it herself over the shifting sands.</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Did you help me?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[Stop talking.]</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_黑渊白花空手" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <text>The golden-haired green-eyed Raksha knelt down next to her.</text>
      <dialog chara="001">[You’re very lucky. These aren’t serious injuries.]</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>[em italic color=#FAFAD2]Are you kidding?[/em]</p>
        <p>Li Sushang wanted to ask, but she ended up not saying a word. </p>
      </text>
      <text>She laid there peacefully, waiting to see what other kinds of tricks were up the Raksha’s sleeve.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3.1" />
      <se id="01-69黑渊白花效果音" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_黑渊白花空手特效" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <text>Unsurprisingly, the Raksha opened his palm and allowed a golden-blue light to spill forth from the void, forming into an item.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_黑渊白花4" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <text>
        <p>From Sushang’s perspective, it looked like a white umbrella with some strange crests. </p>
        <p>Its body was elongated and its tip was sharp.</p>
      </text>
      <se looptimes="0" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Are you going to poke me with that?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[Stop talking.]</dialog>
      <text>The Raksha repeated.</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_黑渊白花6" />
      <text>His falling hair covered his eyes, and Sushang saw a drop of something, either sweat or a tear, drip from his face. [\s]The Raksha held the pitch black handle of the umbrella, placing its tip on Sushang’s injury, and said:</text>
      <dialog chara="001">
        <p>[It won’t hurt, but it’ll feel a bit strange… </p>
        <p>Probably a little numb or sore, can you try not to move?]</p>
      </dialog>
      <text>Sushang wanted to nod, but the pain from her injuries caused her to blink in response instead.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[...I believe you.]</dialog>
      <text>She didn’t even know if she was able to say that.</text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg duration="2" img="CG_第一折_黑渊白花5" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <text>The pain began to subside from the area the Raksha was touching with the tip of his umbrella. [\s]Using her Blade Mantra, Sushang could see that the Raksha was directing Ki into her injuries. </text>
      <text>It was clearly a costly endeavor judging from the sweat pooling on his face.</text>
      <text>
        <p>[em italic color=#FAFAD2]Do golden-haired people sweat gold too?[/em]</p>
        <p>Li Sushang thought, slightly embarrassed, excited, shy, and a little sorry for thinking that of him.</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="001">[There’s too much of a gap between the functionality of the simulated ones…]</dialog>
      <text>The Raksha said to himself.</text>
      <dialog chara="001">[It’ll need some time.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[Ok.]</dialog>
      <text>Both the Raksha and Li Sushang stopped talking.</text>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <cg />
      <bg img="BGSky03" />
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>The nightly breeze blew through the Raksha’s long golden locks. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Li Sushang could feel a slight tickling sensation from where it brushed past on her face. </p>
        <p>She wanted to say something, but didn’t in the end.</p>
      </mono>
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>She instead closed her eyes. [\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>It was like what the Raksha said, she felt both numbness and soreness inside her. It was a strange feeling, but she could deal with it.</p>
      </mono>
      <bgm id="侠女之声（女抒情）" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Sigh~]</dialog>
      <text>She thought about the past day.</text>
      <cg img="氛围_第一折_金沙帮众" duration="1" />
      <bg img="BGSky03" />
      <text>First, she defeated four desert bandits and got a taste of what being a prisoner was like.</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_鹰李对峙_鹰惊李伸手" duration="1" />
      <text>Then, she had an honorable duel with the man named “Eagle”, though she won by a thread.</text>
      <cg duration="1" img="CG_第一折_抢剑_鹰李" />
      <text>Despite seriously injuring the boss of the Golden Sand Gang, she was in pretty bad shape too.</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_黑渊白花6" />
      <text>She also met this strange foreigner and was watching him heal her wounds with sorcery.</text>
      <cg />
      <text>[em italic color=#FAFAD2]What a long day…[/em]</text>
      <text>
        <p>The life and death experience she had today was a great step for the girl. </p>
        <p>It was as if a lifetime had passed since this morning.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Satisfaction and emptiness. Joy and sorrow. </p>
        <p>Unknown feelings swarmed and mixed together in Li Sushang’s heart.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Slowly, the pain disappeared. [\s]</p>
        <p>What replaced it was the small plant of pride taking root in the girl’s heart.</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Haha, you… You’re going to suffer later if you don’t know the ways of Shenzhou.]</dialog>
      <text>Li Sushang quietly said, looking at the silver moon hanging in the sky.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[We’re not supposed to have outside help during a duel. [\s]There were a lot of spectators just now, and they’ll be sure to call you a weasel or evil. You’re a foreigner, so it’s best to not stir up too much trouble here.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[Fine. I could’ve just watched you die on the sidelines then.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[Hehe…]</dialog>
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_黑渊白花6" duration="2" />
      <delay t="2" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Thanks. You’re not a bad Raksha. You, you're good…]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[Ha.]</dialog>
      <text>The Raksha didn’t look at her. Instead, he was still focusing on transferring his Ki through that white umbrella to heal her wounds.</text>
      <dialog chara="001">[No need to thank me. I have something to ask of you too.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[Hmm? What?]</dialog>
      <text>The girl was suddenly curious.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[Well let’s hear it. You saved my life, so no matter what it is that you need, I’ll give it my all.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[Just now underground, you said that your martial art was called the Edge of Taixuan? The exclusive teachings of the Celestial Phoenix?]</dialog>
      <text>The Raksha said casually.</text>
      <dialog chara="001">[Who’s that? And why do you call her a Celestial?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[Because she’s truly a Celestial, an incredibly powerful one too. They say that she’s immortal since she still looks like a maiden even after thousands of years.]</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2.1" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_黑渊白花空手特效" duration="0.9" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <cg img="CG_第一折_黑渊白花空手" duration="0.9" />
      <text>The Raksha blinked, and the white umbrella disappeared into thin air.</text>
      <dialog chara="001">[Do you know where she is?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[Me? No idea.]</dialog>
      <text>Li Sushang bit her lips to hide her excitement.</text>
      <dialog chara="002">[But you’ve asked the right person. If there’s anyone who knows the whereabouts of the Celestial, then it has to be my master. </dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">Did you know that the Celestial took in seven disciples? Both my mom and my master were her disciples…]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="002">[Wait, do you want to see the Celestial?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="001">[...]</dialog>
      <text>The Raksha stared at her and cracked a smile:</text>
      <cg img="CG_第一折_黑渊白花空手笑" />
      <dialog chara="001">[I do.]</dialog>
      <text>Perhaps he didn’t realize that this was the first time he’d smiled so freely and joyfully after leaving the west on his journey to Shenzhou.</text>
      <text>Li Sushang didn’t know his past nor his pain, but she knew just how big his smile was right now. [\s]An impulse claimed the girl’s instincts as she leapt up: </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="2" />
      <bg img="废弃驿站" />
      <cg />
      <motion chara="002" action="show" pos="right" img="素裳-龇牙-普通-中景" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="001" action="show" pos="left" img="奥托-微笑释然-标准-中景" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1.5" />
      <dialog chara="002">[Then come with me! We’ll go back and get my master to take us to see the Celestial!]</dialog>
      <motion chara="001" action="img_trans" img="奥托-笑容释然-标准-中景" />
      <event action="achievement" aid="0587835ecd47f23d" />
      <notification>伝記更新：「羅刹人」</notification>
      <motion chara="001" action="hide" duration="3" />
      <motion chara="002" action="hide" duration="3" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="3" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="Chapter01end" />
      <delay t="4" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="3" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
      <event action="goto" to="22" />
    </scene>
    <scene id="22" prev="21" title="終わり">
      <transition mode="fade" in="0" stop="0.5" out="3" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="入云阶" pos="0,-600" duration="3" />
      <bgm id="天穹" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Heaven’s Pinnacle, Cloud Strider Stairway.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="10" />
      <bg img="入云阶" duration="10" pos="0,0" />
      <delay t="10" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>Heaven’s Pinnacle towers over the sky, the mountain’s steps stretching over a thousand feet.</p>
        <p />
        <p>Looking up, you couldn’t see the end of the stone stairs, only misty clouds hanging up with a glance.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="5" />
      <bg img="天穹峰顶-外景" duration="5" scale="2" origin="80%,50%" />
      <delay t="4" />
      <bg img="天穹峰顶-外景" duration="7" origin="80%,50%" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>The mountain is a high mountain; on top of this mountain, is also a high person. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>After climbing several thousand stone steps, I saw a small pathetic view called 「Kumo」 at the top of its peak.</p>
      </mono>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="6" />
      <bg img="拂云观-侧面" duration="10" />
      <delay t="6" />
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Regardless of name, shape, or furnishings, this Fog Mount Temple was an exact replica of the former Celestial Phoenix’s abode on Mount Taixuan.</p>
        <p>The master of this temple,</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Was the Head of one of the Six Great Sects of Shenzhou [School of Taixuan];</p>
        <p>Phoenix’s eldest disciple: [Willowfoil] Lin Zhaoyu.</p>
        <p>…The Head is very quiet, plus the road was both long and arduous;</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p />
        <p>If the disciples of the School of Taixuan don’t have anything to do, they will never ascend the Cloud Strider Stairway. </p>
        <p>Therefore, this day should’ve been an average day, a quiet and ordinary day.</p>
        <p />
        <p>Knock, knock, knock.</p>
      </mono>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <se id="01-70敲门声" looptimes="3" />
      <text>[em delay=1] Knock, [/em][em delay=1] Knock, [/em][em delay=0.5] Knock.[/em]</text>
      <text>Now there’s an uninvited guest, who knocked on Fog Mount Temple’s door with a smile. </text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="004" action="show" pos="center" img="苏湄-自信-标准-中景（带武器）" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>This person is wearing a bold and easy-to-move suit, carrying twin yin-yang swords, born with vermillion hair and a jade-like face, and looks very beautiful.</text>
      <text>
        <p>Although she rarely walked around in the Jianghu Society, she and her disciples acted at a low profile;[\s]</p>
        <p>But the name of this person was almost as prominent as the Heads and Elders of the Six Great Sects.</p>
      </text>
      <notification>伝記解放：「蘇湄」</notification>
      <event action="achievement" aid="809d736ce396e092" />
      <text>
        <p>She is Phoenix’s second disciple, the current master of [Ushuang’s Hall],[\s]</p>
        <p>[Ushuang Exarch] ——Su Mei.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="004" action="hide" />
      <bg img="拂云观-侧面" scale="1.5" origin="0%,50%" duration="3" />
      <se id="01-70敲门声" />
      <text>Knock.</text>
      <bg img="拂云观-侧面" duration="1" origin="0%,50%" />
      <text>Her knuckles tapped on the wooden door lightly, the sound loud and undisturbed, it was slightly crisp and nice.</text>
      <motion chara="004" action="show" pos="right" img="苏湄-标准-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <text>There wasn’t a response from the room, yet the red haired woman wasn’t angry, her face’s smile continued to be calm.</text>
      <se id="01-70敲门声2" />
      <text>Knock, knock.</text>
      <motion chara="004" action="hide" duration="0" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="3" />
      <se id="01-71开门声" />
      <bg img="拂云观-侧面（开门）" duration="3" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <text>Finally, the door opened.</text>
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="4" />
      <bg img="拂云观-亮" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <motion chara="003" action="show" pos="center" duration="3" img="林朝雨-不悦-标准-中景" />
      <delay t="3" />
      <text>
        <p>As if she was unaware of the knocker’s long wait, </p>
        <p>[Willowfoil] Lin Zhaoyu walked out of the house slowly, staring coldly at her former Second Junior Sister.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="003" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="fade" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <bg img="拂云观-侧面（开门）" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="003" action="show" pos="left" img="林朝雨-标准-标准-远景" />
      <motion chara="004" action="show" pos="right" img="苏湄-甜笑-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <notification>伝記解放：「林朝雨」</notification>
      <event action="achievement" aid="fcf2a1388f09b18b" />
      <dialog chara="004">[Senior Sister, how long has it been since you’ve seen me?]</dialog>
      <text>Su Mei smiled enthusiastically, as if she was reuniting with a long lost best friend after many years. [\s]Although there are thousands of smiling faces in the world, this is the only one that Lin Zhaoyu doesn’t know how to deal with.</text>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-认真-标准-远景" />
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-平静-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <dialog chara="003">[...Twenty years.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="004">[Twenty years?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-标准-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <text>[Ushuang] Su Mei thought for a bit, before casually smiling:</text>
      <dialog chara="004">[It’s been that long?]</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>Her voice’s sound floated into Lin Zhaoyu’s ears, like a thin needle stuck in her heart. </p>
        <p>She couldn’t help but glance at the woman in front of her with contempt.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="003" action="hide" />
      <motion chara="004" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="dissolve" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="PureBlack" />
      <motion chara="004" action="show" pos="center" img="苏湄-标准-标准-近景" />
      <text>Over ten years had passed, yet Su Mei hadn't changed at all, and time seemed to have stopped for her.</text>
      <text inline="true">Her hair was still red and vibrant,</text>
      <text>
        <p />
        <p>Her beautiful face was shiny and smooth as fat, it could be broken by a blow.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Her eyes… the eyes were still so big, so alluring… </p>
        <p>Her lips are so red, so red… this vixen, how many sheets of rouge paper did she use?</p>
      </text>
      <text>[em color=#FAFAD2 italic]… …Why was it her? Why wasn’t it me?[/em]</text>
      <motion chara="004" action="hide" />
      <transition mode="eye" in="1" stop="0.5" out="1" color="#000000" />
      <bg img="拂云观-侧面（开门）" />
      <motion chara="003" action="show" pos="left" img="林朝雨-愤恨-标准-远景" />
      <motion chara="004" action="show" pos="right" img="苏湄-标准-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <text>Envy filled Lin Zhaoyu’s heart in an instant, it boiled extremely quickly, and it froze; it was hot like ice, it was cold like fire.</text>
      <text>Su Mei seemed to see through her thoughts, and let out a sigh at this moment.</text>
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-闭目-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-标准-标准-远景" />
      <dialog chara="004">[Aye, twenty years, I’ve aged too.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="003">[...Really.]</dialog>
      <text>The Head of the School of Taixuan replied softly.</text>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-认真-标准-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">[No need to reminisce, you and I don’t need to chat, just speak if you have something to say.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-瞥视-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <dialog chara="004">[Mm, that’s fine too.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-平静-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <text>A trace of haze seemed to pass over Su Mei’s eyes, it was fleeting, causing Lin Zhaoyu to catch a glimpse of worry in her eyes.</text>
      <dialog chara="004">[...The reason I came to visit my Senior Sister, is because Little Ma got a message.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-惊讶-标准-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">[Yanqing?]</dialog>
      <text>Lin Zhaoyu’s face changed quickly, and sharply said:</text>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-愤怒-标准-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">[Where is he?]</dialog>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>The name Little Ma that came from Su Mei’s mouth, was the two people’s Junior Brother [Tireless Courser] Ma Yanqing. [\s]</p>
        <p />
        <p>This Taixuan Sixth Sword had an arrogant temperament, and he had never been restrained by the world;</p>
        <p />
        <p>This person had a close relationship with [Ushuang] Su Mei, and he was envied by everyone in the Jianghu Society. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Yet he suddenly announced that he would marry a Senior Sister who was more than twenty years older than him, which shook the Jianghu;</p>
        <p />
        <p>On the day of the wedding, he was drunk and nonsensical. He was ashamed of his name and abandoned it, which embarrassed all the guests.</p>
      </mono>
      <mono pageend="true">
        <p />
        <p>Even after getting married, he rarely appeared in the School of Taixuan for a while. </p>
        <p />
        <p>For most of the year, he and his beloved horse [Erebus] wandered around. What he did that was good to hear was said to be [fighting for justice and chivalry], and the ugly, said to be [misbehavior]. </p>
      </mono>
      <mono>
        <p />
        <p>Whether up to the rich and the powerful, or down to bandits… Ma Feima dared to beat anyone, and everyone who provoked him. This [Madman], is indeed the most famous character in the Central Plains. </p>
      </mono>
      <dialog chara="004">
        <p>[Yanqing… Little Ma hates that name very much. </p>
        <p>Yet Senior Sister hasn’t changed her words yet… Alas, Senior Sister is the most nostalgic among us.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-愤恨-标准-远景" />
      <text>
        <p>[em color=#FAFAD2 italic]No…[/em]</p>
        <p>Lin Zhaoyu said in her heart.</p>
        <p>[em color=#FAFAD2 italic]What he hates is the past, which is specifically the past YOU created.[/em]</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>Her thoughts sank into her heart, and the sound was no more.</p>
        <p>She also didn’t resort to words.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-不悦-标准-远景" />
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-闭目-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <dialog chara="003">[Where is he?]</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>Lin Zhaoyu repeated.[\s]</p>
        <p>Su Mei met her gaze quickly and looked away, then sighed:</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-瞥视-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <dialog chara="004">[You know Little Ma’s temperament… he already rushed to the Northern Desert overnight.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="003">[Beyond the Great Wall? …What’s he going to do there?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="004">[To look for Fifth Junior Sister.]</dialog>
      <bgm looptimes="0" />
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-愤恨-标准-远景" />
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-标准-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <dialog chara="003">[——! ! !]</dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-愤恨-持剑-远景" duration="1" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-瞥视-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <text>
        <p>Fiery anger suddenly melted the ice.</p>
        <p>Lin Zhaoyu took a big step forward, and silently slipped a silver longsword into her left hand.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-冷笑-持剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">
        <p>[Su Mei… What the hell are you plotting now? </p>
        <p>It’s been 20 years, do you think we’ll be fooled by you again?!]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-愤恨-持剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">
        <p>[Lingshuang’s secluded whereabouts, did you think Yanqing and I don’t know? </p>
        <p>When she grabbed a Xuanyuan and wandered all over the Central Plains, causing trouble out in the limelight, during that time, who was it who got her out of Southern Hunan? </p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="003">Who was it who secretly protected her on her way to the Northern Desert and helped her settle?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="003">
        <p>[Yanqing’s temperament… heh, I know Yanqing's character, I also know Lingshuang’s temperament. </p>
        <p>Even if the sky fell tomorrow, he won’t disturb Lingshuang with such trivial things or disturb her hermitage. </p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="003">So what? Could you tell me what news is so important, that Yanqing couldn’t even spare the time to tell me?]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="004">「……」</dialog>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-冷笑-持剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">[...It’s still this means, Su Mei, it’s still this. Yanqing is willing to listen to your words,『Little Ma』...hmph. </dialog>
      <dialog chara="003">What about you? You call him at will, pointing east to east, pointing west to west… Who do you take my husband for? Who do you take ME for?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-愤怒-持剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">
        <p>[Su Mei, I’m warning you today.</p>
        <p>If you no longer treasure shared sect comradery in your heart,</p>
        <p>Then I won’t hesitate to fight『Ushuang』!]</p>
      </dialog>
      <dialog chara="004">「……」</dialog>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-愤恨-持剑-远景" />
      <text>
        <p>All of the buried words that’ve been accumulating for years were reprimanded, yet she felt unhappy. </p>
        <p>Lin Zhaoyu was satisfied with the silence from the other party, but she was also surprised about that silence.</p>
      </text>
      <text>
        <p>The wind’s sound whistled, the piercing cold hovered on top of Heaven’s Pinnacle. </p>
        <p>This kind of weather could either fan the flames of rage, or slowly let it smolder until only the ashes of disappointment remained. </p>
      </text>
      <text>After she counted her seventeenth heartbeat, when her patience was about to come to an end, Su Mei spoke up.</text>
      <bgm id="千年之羽" />
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-闭目-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <dialog chara="004">[『Willowfoil』...]</dialog>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-惊讶-持剑-远景" />
      <text>Su Mei didn’t look at her, rather her gaze fixedly fell upon the soft sword in her hand.</text>
      <dialog chara="004">
        <p>[It’s really nostalgic…</p>
        <p>Thanks to it, Wanru could keep her life, and it gave Fifth Junior Sister a moment to stab with that sword.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-自信-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <text>She lifted her head to meet Lin Zhaoyu’s gaze, her eyebrows raised into a smile:</text>
      <dialog chara="004">[Very good, it’s still in your hands.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-惊恐-持剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">[You——]</dialog>
      <text>
        <p>At the mention of that day twenty years ago, Lin Zhaoyu subconsciously took a step back.[\s]</p>
        <p>The cold air condensed to dew on her back, turning into cold sweat under her robes.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-怅然-持剑-远景" />
      <text>
        <p>For many years, the scene of that time had been torturing her like bone decay.</p>
        <p>She thought she had finally left her past behind, but the visit from her Second Sister today has reopened her old scar.</p>
        <p>[We promised to never talk about the old days——]</p>
      </text>
      <dialog chara="003">[Mm. I’m not talking about the old stuff, because the past is gone, and remembering it is useless.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-闭目-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <dialog chara="004">[So, I’m talking about something new.]</dialog>
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-平静-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <dialog chara="004">[...Oh!?]</dialog>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-惊恐-持剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">Lin Zhaoyu was taken aback, and instantly understood the profound meaning of her Junior Sister’s words.</dialog>
      <text>[S-so… you’re saying, Master s-she’s?]</text>
      <dialog chara="003">[Mm.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="004">Su Mei looked up at the sky, as if she noticed something interesting in the air, and had an indiscernible smile. </dialog>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-微笑-别过-远景（带武器）" duration="0.5" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>[Our Xuanyuan Swords are about to be unsheathed again. But if my guess is right… mine will be earlier than yours.]</text>
      <dialog chara="004">[This… you, impossible… </dialog>
      <dialog chara="003">this…]</dialog>
      <text>For the first time in 20 years, the School of Taixuan’s female head showed such a flustered expression. </text>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-怅然-持剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">[...Master’s dead.]</dialog>
      <dialog chara="004">
        <p>[Right, but does death exist to a Celestial? Trust me, Master has returned. </p>
        <p>You, me, Little Ma… none of us seven should want to stay out of this matter.]</p>
      </dialog>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-惊恐-持剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">[...No…]</dialog>
      <text>Lin Zhaoyu looked down in a daze, as if the other party was just saying extremely absurd gossip that wasn’t worth listening to.</text>
      <dialog chara="003">[But… If…]</dialog>
      <text>Her murmurs became weaker.</text>
      <text>
        <p>When she lifted her head at Su Mei again, a smile hung on Lin Zhaoyu’s face. </p>
        <p>It was an extremely angry smile, yet it was also an extremely weary smile.</p>
      </text>
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-怒笑-持剑-远景" />
      <dialog chara="003">[If Master is to settle out the score years ago, the first one to look for is you, Su Mei.]</dialog>
      <text>School of Taixuan’s female head spoke softly. </text>
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-痛苦-别过-远景（带武器）" />
      <dialog chara="004">[Wrong, wrong, Master doesn’t know who the mastermind is. According to inference, I’m still the second one~ But, the order isn’t important. I came to find you for this.] </dialog>
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-平静-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <motion chara="003" action="img_trans" img="林朝雨-心头一震-持剑-远景" />
      <text>She turned her look away from the clouds and gazed at Lin Zhaoyu.</text>
      <text>
        <p>Lin Zhaoyu was shocked.[\s]</p>
        <p>This was what she was very familiar with, her Second Junior Sister’s look in her eyes.</p>
      </text>
      <event action="hide_ui" duration="1" />
      <motion chara="004" action="img_trans" img="苏湄-标准-标准-远景（带武器）" />
      <delay t="1" />
      <text>Su Mei was calmly looking at her, collected and composed. Her eyes showed neither fear, nor panic. </text>
      <dialog chara="004">[Master has already killed one.]  </dialog>
      <transition mode="fade" in="5" stop="0.5" out="0" color="#000000" />
    </scene>
  </scripts>
</data>